ages you build here.'=>'Tarjima qilingan manzillar, SEO ma\'lumotlari va til almashtirgich bilan har bir sahifani ko\'p tillarda chop eting. Bu yerda yaratilgan sahifalar bilan ishlaydi.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Tezkor, SEO izlaridan holi bloklar yordamida sahifalarni bevosita muharrirda loyihalashtiring. Siz qurgan barcha narsa Tranzly yordamida tarjima qilinadi.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s bir xil jamoa tomonidan yaratilgan va ushbu plagin bilan birgalikda ishlaydi.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Avval ushbu saytni ulashga rozi bo\'ling.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Yaroqli elektron pochta manzilini kiriting.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Avval qo‘llab-quvvatlash ma\'lumotlarini yuborishga rozilik bering.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Mavzu va xabar yozing.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati javob berishi mumkin bo‘lgan elektron pochta manzilini kiriting.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'1, 3 yoki 7 kunni tanlang.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Sayt egasi tomonidan yaratilgan vaqtinchalik yordam kirish huquqi. U muddati tugagach avtomatik ravishda oʻchiriladi.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Faqat ushbu ekranga kirgan sayt administratori vaqtinchalik qo\'llab-quvvatlash ruxsatini yaratishi mumkin.','This site already has the most temporary support logins it can have at once. Revoke one below, or send the request without a login.'=>'Bu sayt bir vaqtincha bir vaqtning o\'zida ega bo\'lishi mumkin bo\'lgan eng ko\'p vaqtinchalik yordam loginlariga ega. Quyidagilardan birini bekor qiling yoki loginsiz so\'rov yuboring.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'Noyob foydalanuvchi nomini tanlab bo\'lmadi. Qayta ur