ence and safety'=>'Litsenziya va xavfsizlik','We confirm the licence with the regulator and check how player funds are protected.'=>'Biz regulyator bilan litsenziyani tasdiqlaymiz va o‘yinchi mablag‘lari qanday himoyalanganligini tekshiramiz.','Payouts'=>'To\'lovlar','We deposit and withdraw with real money and time how long each payout takes.'=>'Biz haqiqiy pul bilan kiritamiz va chiqaramiz hamda har bir to\'lov qancha vaqt olishini ko\'rsatamiz.','Bonus terms'=>'Bonus shartlari','We read the wagering rules, caps and time limits so you do not have to.'=>'Garov tikish qoidalari, cheklovlar va vaqt limitlarini sizning o\'rningizga o\'qib chiqdik.','Games'=>'O‘yinlar','We look at the game studios, live tables and published return-to-player figures.'=>'Biz o\'yin studiyalari, jonli stollar va e\'lon qilingan o\'yinchiga qaytish ko\'rsatkichlarini ko\'rib chiqamiz.','Support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash','We contact support by chat and email and rate the speed and the answers.'=>'Biz chat va elektron pochta orqali qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmati bilan bog\'lanamiz hamda tezlik va javoblarni baholaymiz.','Responsible play'=>'Mas\'uliyatli o\'yin','We check for deposit limits, reality checks, cool-off periods and self-exclusion.'=>'Biz depozit limitlari, reallik tekshiruvlari, tanaffus davrlari va o‘zini o‘zi chetlatish holatlarini tekshiramiz.','Call to action'=>'Harakatga chaqiruv','Charity'=>'Xayriya','Help a child go to school'=>'Bolaga maktabga borishga yordam bering','Give once or give monthly.'=>'Bir martaba yoki oylik ehrom qiling.','Donate now'=>'Hozir xayriya qilish','Hero'=>'Asosiy banner','Registered charity'=>'Roʻyxatdan oʻtgan xayriya tashkiloti','Every child deserves a safe place to learn'=>'Har bir bola xavfsiz o\'quv muhitiga loyiq','We build classrooms, train teachers and provide school meals in communities that need them most.'=>'Biz eng muhtoj jamoalarda sinfxonalar quramiz, o\'qituvchilarni o\'qitamiz va maktab tushliklarini ta\'minlaymiz.','Our impact'=>'Bizning ta\'sirimiz','Steps'=>'Qadamlar','How it works'=>'Qanday ishlaydi','You give'=>'Siz berasiz','Online, by phone or by post.'=>'Onlayn, telefon orqali yoki pochta orqali.','We fund projects'=>'Biz loyihalarni moliyalashtiramiz','Chosen with our local partners.'=>'Mahalliy hamkorlarimiz bilan birga tanlangan.','You see the impact'=>'Siz ta\'sirini ko\'rasiz','Updates and stories from the field.'=>'Yangilanishlar va maydondan hikoyalar.','Dental Clinic'=>'Stomatologiya klinikasi','Frequently asked questions'=>'Ko\'p beriladigan savollar','Are you taking new patients?'=>'Yangi bemorlarni qabul qilyapsizmi?','Yes. You can book your first visit online.'=>'Ha. Birinchi tashrifingizni onlayn bron qilishingiz mumkin.','Do you offer payment plans?'=>'To‘lov rejalarini taklif qilasizmi?','Yes, interest-free plans are available for larger treatments.'=>'Ha, yirik muoljalar uchun foizsiz rejalar mavjud.','What if I am nervous?'=>'Agar hayajonlanayotgan bo\'lsam-chi?','Tell us when you book. We will take things at your pace.'=>'Qachon band qilganingizni bizga ayting. Biz ishlarni sizning tezligingizda bajaramiz.','Accepting new patients'=>'Yangi bemorlarni qabul qilish','Gentle dental care for the whole family'=>'Butun oila uchun muloyim stomatologik parvarish','Check-ups, hygiene, whitening and implants in a calm, modern clinic. Nervous patients are always welcome.'=>'Tinch, zamonaviy klinikada ko‘riklar, gigiyena, oqartirish va implantlar. Xavotirli bemorlar har doim mamnuniyat bilan qabul qilinadi.','Book an appointment'=>'Uchrashuv belgilash','Our treatments'=>'Bizning muolajalarimiz','Visiting us'=>'Bizga tashrif buyurish','Evening and Saturday appointments'=>'Kechki va shanba kungi uchrashuvlar','Clear prices before treatment'=>'Davolashdan oldin aniq narxlar','Payment plans available'=>'Mavjud toʻlov rejalari','Emergency slots every day'=>'Har kuni favqulodda oʻrinlar','Book online'=>'Onlayn bron qilish','Choose a time that suits you.'=>'O\'zingizga qulay vaqtni tanlang.