or'=>'Marketing direktori','Fitness Gym'=>'Fitness zal','Open 5am to 11pm'=>'Soat 5:00 dan 23:00 gacha ochiq','Stronger every week'=>'Har haftada kuchliroq','Coached classes, open gym and personal training for every level. Your first week is on us.'=>'Murabbiy boshchiligidagi mashg\'ulotlar, ochiq zal va har qanday daraja uchun shaxsiy tayyorgarlik. Birinchi haftangiz bizdan sovg\'a.','Claim a free week'=>'Bepoyta haftani talab qilish','See classes'=>'Sinflarni ko\'rish','Lost 12kg and gained a lot of confidence. The coaches are brilliant.'=>'12 kg yo‘qotdim va o‘zimga bo‘lgan katta ishonchga ega bo‘ldim. Murabbiylar juda zo‘r.','Rachel'=>'Rachel','Member'=>'A\'zo','First gym I have stuck with for more than a month.'=>'Bir oydan ortiq davom etgan birinchi sport zalim.','Sam'=>'Sam','Law Firm'=>'Yuridik firma','Experienced, approachable lawyers'=>'Tajribali, muloyim huquqshunoslar','We are an independent firm built on long-term relationships. Many of our clients have been with us for decades.'=>'Biz uzoq muddatli munosabatlarga asoslangan mustaqil firmamiz. Mijozlarimizning aksariyati o‘nlab yillar davomida biz bilan birga ishlab kelmoqda.','You will always know who is handling your case, what happens next and what it will cost.'=>'Sizning ishingiz bilan kim shug\'ullanayotganini, keyingi qadam nima bo\'lishini va uning narxi qancha turishini har doim bilasiz.','How we work'=>'Biz qanday ishlaymiz','Plain-language advice'=>'Oddiy tildagi maslahat','Fixed fees where possible'=>'Mumkin bo\'lgan joyda sobit to\'lovlar','A named solicitor for your case'=>'Ishingiz uchun tayinlangan yurist','Replies within one working day'=>'Bir ish kuni ichida javob beriladi','Talk to a solicitor'=>'Huquqshunos bilan gaplashing','Book a free 30-minute consultation.'=>'30 daqiqalik bepul maslahatga yoziling.','Request a consultation'=>'Maslahat so‘rash','Practice areas'=>'Amaliyot yo\'nalishlari','Business law'=>'Biznes huquqi','Contracts, disputes, shareholder agreements and company formation.'=>'Shartnomalar, nizolar, aksiyadorlar kelishuvlari va kompaniyani tashkil etish.','Property'=>'Mulk','Buying, selling, leases and commercial property transactions.'=>'Sotib olish, sotish, ijara va tijorat ko\'chmas mulk bitimlari.','Family law'=>'Oila huquqi','Divorce, children arrangements and financial settlements.'=>'Ajralish, bolalar bo\'yicha kelishuvlar va moliyaviy tartibga solish.','Employment'=>'Bandlik','Advice for employers and employees, from contracts to tribunals.'=>'Ish beruvchilar va xodimlar uchun maslahatlar, shartnomalardan tortib to tribunalargacha.','Wills and probate'=>'Vasiyatnomalar va meros ishlarini yuritish','Wills, lasting powers of attorney and estate administration.'=>'Vasiyatnomalar, ishonchnomalar va merosni boshqarish.','Dispute resolution'=>'Nizolarni hal qilish','Negotiation, mediation and litigation when it is needed.'=>'Mmuzokara, vositachilik va zarur boʻlganda sud jarayoni.','Local Plumber'=>'Mahalliy santexnik','Need a plumber today?'=>'Bugun santexnik kerakmi?','Call now or book online. Emergency slots available around the clock.'=>'Hoziroq qo\'ng\'iroq qiling yoki onlayn tarzda bron qiling. Favqulodda vaqtlar kechayu kunduz mavjud.','Book a visit'=>'Tashrif buyurtma qilish','Do you charge a call-out fee?'=>'Chaqiruv haqi olasizmi?','Our fixed price includes the visit. You will know the cost before we start.'=>'Belgilangan narximizga tashrif ham kiradi. Ishni boshlashimizdan oldin xarajatlarni bilib olasiz.','Which areas do you cover?'=>'Qaysi hududlarni qamrab olasiz?','The whole town and every village within 20 miles.'=>'Butun shahar va 20 milya radiusdagi har bir qishloq.','Are you insured?'=>'Sugʻurtalanganmisiz?','Yes, fully insured, and every job has a 12-month guarantee.'=>'Ha, to\'liq sug\'urtalangan va har bir ish 12 oylik kafolatga ega.','24/7 emergency service'=>'24/7 favqulodda xizmat','Fast, friendly plumbing. Fixed right the first time.'=>'Tez va do\'stona santexnika xizmati. Birinchi urinishdayoq to\'g\