r and lead projects with confidence.'=>'Loyihalarni ishonch bilan rejalashtiring, bajaring va boshqaring.','Business writing'=>'Biznes yozish','Clear emails, reports and proposals.'=>'Elektron pochta xabarlari, hisobotlar va takliflarni tozalang.','Niche Authority Site'=>'Nish autoritetiga ega sayt','Start here'=>'Bu yerdan boshlash','The topics readers ask about most.'=>'O‘quvchilar eng ko‘p so‘raydigan mavzular.','Growing vegetables'=>'Sabzavotlar yetishtirish','Raised beds, soil, sowing calendars and harvests.'=>'Baland to‘shaklar, tuproq, ekish taqvimlari va hosil.','Lawn care'=>'Maysalarni parvarish qilish','Feeding, mowing and fixing patchy grass.'=>'Ozuqalantirish, o\'rish va siyrak maysazorlarni tiklash.','Garden tools'=>'Bog\'dorchilik anjomlari','What is worth buying and how to look after it.'=>'Nimani sotib olish arziydi va unga qanday g\'amxo\'rlik qilish kerak.','Small gardens'=>'Kichik bogʻlar','Balconies, patios and containers.'=>'Balkonlar, iç hovlular va konteynerlar.','Practical guides to home gardening'=>'Uyda bog\'dorchilik qilish bo\'yicha amaliy qo\'llanmalar','Straightforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Har hafta oxirida bog‘dorchilik bilan shug‘ullanuvchilar tomonidan yozilgan sabzavotlar yetishtirish, maysazorlarga g‘amxo‘rlik qilish va to‘g‘ri vositalarni tanlash bo‘yicha tushunarli maslahatlar.','Read the latest guides'=>'Eng so\'nggi qo\'llanmalarni o\'qish','About the author'=>'Muallif haqida','Estate Agency'=>'Koʻchmas mulk agentligi','What is your home worth?'=>'Uyingiz qancha turadi?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Bepoul va majburiyatsiz baholashni bron qiling.','Book a valuation'=>'Baholashga buyurtma berish','Free valuation'=>'Bepul baholash','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Mutaxassis kelib uyingizni ko\'zdan kechiradi va baholaydi.','Launch'=>'Ishga tushirish','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Fotosuratlar, qavat rejasi va e\'lon bir necha kun ichida faollashadi.','Sold'=>'Sotilgan','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Biz savdoni yakunigacha muzokara qilamiz va boshqaramiz.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'Seshanbadan yakshanbagacha ochiq','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Mavsumiy pishiriqlar, ulashish uchun mo\'ljallangan','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Mahalliy mahsulotlar, o\'tin pechi va uni sevuvchilar tomonidan tanlangan vino ro\'yxati. Tushlik va kechki ovqat, haftasiga olti kun.','Book a table'=>'Stol band qilish','See the menu'=>'Menuni ko\'rish','From our kitchen'=>'Bizning oshxonamizdan','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Mavsumga qarab o‘zgarib turadigan qisqa aksiya menyusi. Allergiyangiz haqida bizga xabar bering: mamnuniyat bilan moslashtirib beramiz.','Small plates'=>'Kichik taomlar','Charred flatbreads, cured meats and garden vegetables to start.'=>'Birinchidan yupqa nonlar, tuzlangan go\'sht va bog\' sabzavotlari.','From the fire'=>'Olovdan','Whole fish, aged steaks and roasted vegetables from the wood oven.'=>'O\'tin pechidan butun baliq, yetuk steyklar va qovurilgan sabzavotlar.','Fresh pasta'=>'Yangi pasta','Made by hand every morning, served with seasonal sauces.'=>'Har kuni ertalab qo\'lda tayyorlanadi, mavsumiy souslar bilan tortiladi.','Desserts'=>'Desertlar','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'Mahalliy ishlab chiqaruvchilardan piroglar, muzqaymoqlar va pishloq taxtasi.','Set lunch'=>'Tushlikni sozlash','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'Seshanbadan jumagacha belgilangan narxda ikki yoki uchta kurs.','Private dining'=>'Maxfiy ovqatlanish xonasi','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'Maxsus tayyorlangan menyuga ega, 18 nafargacha mehmon uchun mo\'ljallangan shaxsiy xona.','SaaS Product'=>'SaaS mahsuloti','Is there a free plan?'=>'Bepul tarif mavjudmi?','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'Ha, kichik jamoalar uchun bepul va har bir pullik reja 14 kunlik sinov muddati bilan boshlanadi.','Can I cancel any time?'=>'Istalgan vaqtda bekor qila olamanmi?','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'Ha. Oylik rejalar istalgan vaqtda bekor qilinishi mumkin.','Where is my data stored?'=>'Ma\'lumotlarim qayerda saqlanadi?','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'Xavfsiz, shifrlangan ma\'lumotlar markazlarida, kunlik zaxira nusxalari bilan.','Everything your team needs'=>'Jamoangizga kerak bo\'lgan hamma narsa','Boards and timelines'=>'Doska va vaqt jadvallari','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'Birgina tugmani bosish orqali kanban doskalari va vaqt jadvallari o\'rtasida o\'ting.','Automations'=>'Avtomatlashtirish','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'Vazifalarni ko\'chiring, mas\'ullarni tayinlang va eslatmalarni avtomatik ravishda yuboring.','Shared files'=>'Umumiy fayllar','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Hujjatlarni ular tegishli bo\'lgan ish yonida saqlang.','Reports'=>'Hisobotlar','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Ish yuki, jarayon va muddatlar uchun real vaqt rejimidagi boshqaruv panellari.','Integrations'=>'Integratsiyalar','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'Allaqachon foydalanayotgan elektron pochta, chat va xotira vositalarini ulang.','Security'=>'Xavfsizlik','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Yagona kirish, audit loglari va shifrlangan ma\'lumotlar.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'14 kunlik bepul sinov muddati, karta talab qilinmaydi','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Jadvallarni emas, loyihalarni rejalashtiring','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Vazifalar, muddatlar va fayllar uchun bitta ish maydoni. Jamoangiz bugun nima muhimligini ko\'radi, siz esa yangilanishlarni so\'ramasdan jarayonni kuzatasiz.','Start free trial'=>'Bepul sinov muddatini boshlash','See features'=>'Funksiyalarni ko\'rish','Up and running in minutes'=>'Bir necha daqiqada ishga tushadi','Create a workspace'=>'Ishchi maydon yaratish','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Roʻyxatdan oʻting va jamoangizni bir necha daqiqada taklif qiling.','Import your work'=>'Ishingizni import qilish','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Vazifalarni elektron jadval yoki boshqa vositadan olib keling.','Get moving'=>'Boshlash','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Andozalar va avtomatlashtirishlar mayda-chuyda ishlarni bajaradi.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Ushbu elementni tahrirlashga ruxsatingiz yoʻq.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Buni qilishga ruxsat etilmagan.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim o\'chirildi, chunki u endi sizning kirishingizga mos kelmaydi. Sahifani qayta yuklang.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Faqat administrator xavfsiz rejimdan foydalana oladi.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim odatiy brauzer orqali kirishni talab qiladi.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni oʻrnatib boʻlmadi.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim wp-content/mu-plugins papkasiga yozish huquqiga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim wp-content/mu-plugins papkasiga yoza olmadi.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Bu sahifa mavjud emas yoki o‘chirib yuborilgan.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio blok muharriri bilan ishlaydi, va ushbu element uchun blok muharriri o\'chirilgan. Classic Editor kabi plagin shunday qiladi: uning sozlamalarida ushbu element uchun blok muharririga ruxsat bering (Sozlamalar → Yozish), so\'ngra Sandwich Studio\'ni qaytadan oching.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Kechirasiz, sizga Sandwich Studio’da bu elementni tahrirlashga ruxsat etilmagan.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio o\'rnatilmagan. Plaginni qaytadan o\'rnating.','Add title'=>'Sarlavha qo\'shish','Type / to choose a block'=>'Blokni tanlash uchun / kiriting','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Sandwich Studio yuklanmoqda…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio uchun JavaScript kerak. Buning o\'rniga oddiy tahrirlagichni ishlating.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'“%s” nomini Sandwich Studio yordamida tahrirlash','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio bilan tahrirlash','Blank canvas'=>'Bo\'sh sahifa','Skip to content'=>'Asosiy qismga o\'tish','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Planshet kengligi 480 dan 2560 gacha bo\'lgan butun piksellar sonidan iborat bo\'lishi kerak.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Mobil eni butun piksel soni bo\'lishi kerak, kamida 240 va planshet enidan kichik bo\'lishi lozim.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Har bir maxsus nuqta o\'z id raqamiga ega bo\'lishi kerak: harfdan boshlanadigan 2 dan 12 tagacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlar.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Maxsus nuqta (breakpoint) yo faqat maʼlum bir kenglikkacha (200 dan 4000 pikselsacha) yoki maʼlum bir kenglikdan boshlab (200 dan 6000 pikselsacha) qo\'llaniladi, ikkalasi bir vaqtning o\'zida emas.','Tablet'=>'Planshet','Mobile'=>'Mobil','Site design'=>'Sayt dizayni','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Saytning har bir sahifasi va uslubingiz tomonidan umumiy foydalaniladigan ranglar, shriftlar va uslublar.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Saytning global uslublarini ochib boʻlmadi.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Bu shrift sayt shriftlaridan biri emas.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Har bir rang kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan iborat noyob nomga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'"%s" rangi yaroqli CSS rangi emas.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Har bir shrift kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan iborat noyob nomga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'"%s" uchun shriftlar toʻplamida faqat shrift nomlari, qoʻshtirnoqlar, vergullar va boʻshliqlar boʻlishi mumkin.','Uploaded icons'=>'Yuklangan nishonchalar','Icon'=>'Nishon','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Bu fayl biz foydalana oladigan SVG ikonka emas. U shikastlangan bo\'lishi mumkin yoki xavfsizlik maqsadida olib tashlangan tarkibni (skriptlar, havolalar, o\'rnatilgan rasmlar yoki shriftlar) o\'z ichiga olgan bo\'lishi mumkin.','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Belgini o\'chirib bo\'lmadi.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'litsenziya kaliti','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Litsenziya bilan hali foydalanuvchi bog\'lanmagan, bu ruxsatsiz faollashtirishning oldini olish uchun zarur. Litsenziyani o\'z foydalanuvchingizga biriktirish orqali siz WordPress foydalanuvchingizning to\'liq ismi va elektron pochta manzilini ulashishga rozilik bildirasiz.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'yuqorida tilga olingan saytlar','Account'=>'Hisob','Account Details'=>'Hisob Ma\'lumotlari','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Hisobni faollashtirish kutilmoqda. Iltimos, elektron pochtangizni tekshiring va hisobingizni faollashtirish uchun havodolani bosing, so\'ngra hamkorlik formasini qaytadan yuboring.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'%1$s ni %2$s bilan birlashtirmoqchimisiz?','Actions'=>'Amallar','Activate'=>'Faollashtirish','Activate Free Version'=>'Bepul versiyani faollashtirish','Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish','activate a license here'=>'litsenziyani shu yerda faollashtirish','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Xarid qilganingizdan keyin darhol elektron pochtangizga kelgan litsenziya kalitini kiriting:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'%1$s ning pullik versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. %2$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun uni faollashtiring. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'%1$s ning pulli versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. Uni faollashtirish va %3$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun %2$s bo\'limiga o\'ting.','Activate this add-on'=>'Ushbu qo‘shimchani faollashtirish','Activate %s'=>'%s ni faollashtirish','Activate %s features'=>'%s funksiyalarini faollashtirish','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'"%s" faollashtirishni hoziroq yakunlash','Activate %s Plan'=>'%s rejasini faollashtirish','Activated'=>'Faollashtirilgan','Activating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','Activating license'=>'Litsenziya faollashtirilmoqda','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Hisobingiz %s tarifi bilan muvaffaqiyatli faollashtirildi.','active add-onActive'=>'Faol','Add another domain'=>'Boshqa domen qo\'shish','Add-Ons'=>'Qo‘shimchalar','Add Ons for %s'=>'%s uchun qo‘shimchalar','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Qo‘shimchalar ro‘yxatini yuklay olmadik. Bu ehtimol biz tomondagi muammo, iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so‘ng qayta urinib ko‘ring.','Add-On'=>'Qo\'shimcha','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s faqat premium qoʻshimcha hisoblanadi. Plaginni faollashtirishdan oldin avval litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'%s qo\'shimchasi muvaffaqiyatli sotib olindi.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Sizning %s qo\'shimcha rejangiz muvaffaqiyatli yangilandi.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s bepul sinov muddati muvaffaqiyatli bekor qilindi. Qo\'shimcha faqat premium bo\'lgani sababli u avtomatik ravishda o\'chirib qo\'yildi. Uni kelajakda ishlatishni xohlasangiz, litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s plaginsiz ishlay olmaydi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s siz ishlay olma