ishda davom etishingiz mumkin, ammo %s funksiyalaridan foydalana olmaysiz.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng, agar uni yaroqli premium litsenziya bilan qaytadan faollashtirmasangiz, %s dan foydalana olmaysiz.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Siz hali ham barcha %1$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishingiz mumkin, lekin %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlariga, shuningdek, qo‘llab-quvvatlashga ega bo‘lmaysiz.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bepul %1$s davridan keyin %2$s dan boshlab to‘lang','Agree & Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani qabul qilish va faollashtirish','I Agree - Change User'=>'Roziman - Foydalanuvchini o‘zgartirish','All Requests'=>'Barcha soʻrovlar','All Types'=>'Barcha turlar','allow'=>'ruxsat berish','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Siz %s ni yaxshilashga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga allaqachon rozilik bildirgansiz.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Siz allaqachon ularni yanada yaxshilashimizga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozi bo‘lgansiz.','Amount'=>'Miqdor','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Yillik','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Yillik','Anonymous feedback'=>'Anonim fikr-mulohaza','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarga qo\'llash.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarga nisbatan qo\'llash.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo\'lish uchun ariza topshiring','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Tasdiqlash va sinov muddatini boshlash','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Takomillashishimiz uchun iltimos sababini ayting.','