ta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Beta versiyasiga yangilash %s ning o\'rnatilgan versiyasini eng so\'nggi Beta versiyasi bilan almashtiradi - ehtiyotkorlik bilan foydalaning va uni produktiv (ishlab chiqarish) saytlarida ishlatmang. Siz ogohlantirildingiz.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'%s bo‘yicha hisob-kitob qilingan','Billing'=>'Hisob-kitob','Billing & Invoices'=>'Hisob-kitoblar va schyotlar','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Bloklangan','Blocking'=>'Bloklanmoqda','Blog ID'=>'Blog ID','Body'=>'Asosiy qism','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ha - ikkala manzil ham o\'zimniki','Bundle'=>'To‘plam','Bundle Plan'=>'To\'plam rejasi','Business name'=>'Biznes nomi','Buy license'=>'Litsenziyani sotib olish','Buy a license now'=>'Hozir litsenziya sotib oling','Cancel'=>'Bekor qilish','Cancel Installation'=>'O\'rnatishni bekor qilish','Cancel Subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Agar siz bu %1$s ni ushbu saytda (yoki boshqa biron bir saytda) ishlatishni rejalashtirmayotgan boʻlsangiz, shuningdek %2$s ni ham bekor qilishni xohlaysizmi?','Cancel Trial'=>'Sinov muddatini bekor qilish','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Sinov muddatini bekor qilish barcha premium funksiyalarga kirishni darhol bloklaydi. Ishonchingiz komilmi?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'%s ni bekor qilish va davom etish','Cancelled'=>'Bekor qilingan','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Litsenziya kalitingizni topa olmadingizmi?','Change License'=>'Litsenziyani o\'zgartirish','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'%s manziliga tasdiqlash xati yuborildi. Yangilanishni keyingi 4 soat ichida tasdiqlashingiz k