tib olganda %s komissiya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Potensial qaytarishlar uchun 30 kunni saqlab qolganimiz sababli, biz faqat 30 kundan oshgan komissiyalarni to\'laymiz.','Communication'=>'Aloqa','Compatible up to'=>'Quyidagicha mos keladi','complete the opt-in'=>'obunani yakunlash','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Tabriklaymiz','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s ga yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiyalar yangilanishlari, o‘quv qo‘llanmalari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti ma\'lumotlarini ulashish uchun ro‘yxatdan o‘ting. Bu bizga %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, oʻquv materiallari hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar boʻyicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida baʼzi maʼlumotlarni ulashish uchun roʻyxatdan oʻting.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham muammo yo\'q! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormasligingiz va %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq hamda siz xohlagan vazifalarni bajarishda samaraliroq qilishimizga yordam berish uchun ushbu ixtiyoriy funksiyani joriy qildik.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Freemius tarmoq darajasidagi integratsiyasini taqdim etishdan mamnunmiz.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida tarmoqda hali e\'tiboringizni talab qiladigan %s ta sayt aniqlandi.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida litsenziyasi faollashtirilishi kutilayotgan %d ta sayt aniqlandi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Agar siz ushbu saytlarda %s dan foydalanishni istasangiz, iltimos, litsenziya kalitingizni quyiga kiriting va faollashtirish tugmasini bosing.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Shuningdek, buni hozircha oʻtkazib yuborishingiz va litsenziyani keyinroq %s tarmogʻi darajasidagi Hisob qaydnomasi sahifasida faollashtirishingiz mumkin.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ulentgan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Tugatganingizdan so\'ng, %s ni o\'chiring va uni qayta yoqing.','Contact'=>'Aloqa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksional yangilanishlar, o\'quv materiallari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar yuzasidan siz bilan bog\'lanishimizni istasangiz, iltimos, bizga xabar bering:','Contact Support'=>'Yordam xizmati bilan bog\'lanish','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Noqulaylik uchun uzr so\'raymiz va agar bizga imkon bersangiz, yordam berishga tayyormiz.','Contact Us'=>'Biz bilan bog‘laning','Please contact us here'=>'Biz bilan shu yerda bog\'laning','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Iltimos, quyidagi xabar bilan biz bilan bog\'laning:','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Contributors'=>'Ishtirokchilar','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'%s ni faollashtirib bo‘lmadi.','Country'=>'Mamlakat','Cron Type'=>'Cron turi','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Biz API chaqiruvlari uchun juda keng tarqalgan va odatda o\'rnatilgan hamda sukut bo\'yicha faollashtirilgan PHP cURL kutubxonasidan foydalanamiz. Afsuski, cURL serveringizda faollashtirilmagan (yoki o\'chirilgan).','data'=>'ma\'lumotlar','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Nosozliklarni tuzatish rejimi muvaffaqiyatli yoqildi va 60 daqiqadan so\'ng avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi. Shuningdek, "Debugni to\'xtatish" havolasini bosish orqali uni ertaroq o\'chirishingiz mumkin.','Date'=>'Sana','Deactivate'=>'Faollashtirmaslik','Deactivate the free version'=>'Bepul versiyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivate License'=>'Litsenziyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Litsenziyangizni faolsizlantirish barcha premium funksiyalarni bloklaydi, biroq litsenziyani boshqa saytda faollashtirish imkonini beradi. Davom etishni xohlayotganingizga aminmisiz?','Deactivation'=>'Faollashtirmasizlik','Yes - %s'=>'Ha - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Yuborish va %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'%s ni oʻchirish yoki olib tashlash litsenziyani avtomatik ravishda faolsizlantiradi, shunda uni boshqa saytda ishlatishingiz mumkin boʻladi.'