, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'W00t','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'WordPress.org plagin sahifasi','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Autentifikatsiya parametrlaridan biri noto‘g‘ri ko‘rinadi. Ochiq kalitingizni (Public Key), Maxfiy kalitingizni (Secret Key) va Foydalanuvchi identifikatorini (User ID) yangilang va qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.','%s ago'=>'%s oldin','as 5 licenses left%s left'=>'%s qoldi','%s or higher'=>'%s yoki undց yuqori','%s\'s paid features'=>'%s ning pullik funksiyalari','e.g. Professional Plan%s Plan'=>'%s Reja','%s rating'=>'%s reytingi','%s ratings'=>'%s ta baho','%s sec'=>'%s son.','%s star'=>'%s ta yulduz','%s stars'=>'%s ta yulduz','%s time'=>'%s vaqt','%s times'=>'%s marta','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'Siz %s muvaffaqiyatli yangiladingiz.','as annual periodyear'=>'yil','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Yee-haw','Yes'=>'Ha','You are all good!'=>'Hammasi joyida!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Siz atigi bir qadam uzoqdasiz - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Siz eng so‘nggi versiyani olganga o‘xshaysiz.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Sizga keyingi 5 daqiqa ichida %2$s manzilidagi pochta qutingizga %1$s uchun %3$s kelishi kerak.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'ZIP / Pochta indeksi',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s versiya %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda qo‘llab-quvvatlashdan foydalanish uchun.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s avtomatik xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda pullik funksiyalar %2$s gacha (yoki litsenziyangiz muddati tugaguncha, qaysi biri oldinroq sodir bo\'lishiga qarab) uzluksiz ishlaydi.','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda qo‘llab-quvvatlashdan foydalanish uchun %2$s versiyasi.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Foydalanuvchining beta rejimini oʻrnatishga urinish vaqtida nomaʼlum xatolik yuz berdi.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Litsenziyaning oq yorliq (white-label) rejimini yoqish/o‘chirish vaqtida noma’lum xatolik yuz berdi.','Annual'=>'Yillik','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'"Opt Out" tugmasini bosish orqali %s endi sizning ismingiz va elektron pochtangizni ko\'ra olmaydi.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'"Voz kechish" tugmasini bosish orqali diagnostika ma\'lumotlari endi %s ga yuborilmaydi.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Veb-saytni uzish orqali %1$s haqida ilgari ulashilgan diagnostika maʼlumotlari oʻchirilib, %2$s uchun endi koʻrinmaydi.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Ushbu ma\'lumotni yangilanishlar serveri bilan ulashishdan voz kechish orqali siz yangi %1$s versiyalarini o\'zingiz tekshirishingiz, ularni qo\'lda yuklab olishingiz va o\'rnatishingiz kerak bo\'ladi. Bu nafaqat noqulaylik tug\'diradi, balki yangilanishni o\'tkazib yuborish veb-saytingizni xavf ostiga qo\'yishi va asossiz moslik muammolarini keltirib chiqarishi mumkin, shuning uchun ushbu muhim ruxsatnomalarni yoqilgan holda qoldirishingizni qat\'iy tavsiya qilamiz.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'%1$s ni bekor qilish - Men %3$s ni ushbu yoki boshqa biron bir saytda ishlatishni rejalashtirmayotganim sababli %2$s uchun xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda qo\'llab-quvvatlashga bo\'lgan ehtiyojim qolmadi.','Cancel %s?'=>'%s ni bekor qilish mumkinmi?','Cancelling %s'=>'%s bekor qilinmoqda','Cancelling %s...'=>'%s bekor qilinmoqda...','Click here'=>'Bu yerni bosing','Deactivating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Veb-saytni uzish %s ni Foydalanuvchi boshqaruv panelidagi hisobingizdan butunlay olib tashlaydi.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlarini avtomatik yetkazib berish, shuningdek litsenziyani boshqarish va himoya qilish uchun %s quyidagilarni bajarishi kerak:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksional yangilanishlarni yetkazib berish hamda litsenziyani boshqarish uchun %s quyidagilarga muhtoj:','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius — bu bizning litsenziyalash va dasturiy ta\'minot yangilanishlari mexanizmimiz','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Agar bu uzoq muddatli dublikat bo\'lsa, %1$s dan keyin avtomatik yangilanishlar va pullik funksionallikni saqlab qolish uchun %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'%2$s %4$s ning dublikatiymi?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Beta dasturiga qo\'shilish','Join the Beta program'=>'Beta dasturiga qo\'shilish','License'=>'Litsenziya','License Key'=>'Litsenziya kaliti','License key'=>'Litsenziya kaliti','Monthly'=>'Oylik','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Nomlar, sluglar, versiyalar va faol yoki faol emasligi','New Version Available'=>'Yangi versiya mavjud','Optional'=>'Ixtiyoriy','Plan'=>'Tarif rejasasi','Products'=>'Mahsulotlar','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Diagnostika ma\'lumotlarini ulashish veb-saytingizga tegishli qo\'shimcha funksionallikni taqdim etishga, veb-sayt ishdan chiqishiga olib kelishi mumkin bo\'lgan WordPress yoki PHP versiyalarining mos kelmasligining oldini olishga hamda %s qaysi tillar va mintaqalarga tarjima qilinishi va moslashtirilishi kerakligini aniqlashga yordam beradi.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Shu tari %s faol bo‘lmaganda litsenziyani qayta ishlatishingiz mumkin.','Subscription'=>'Obuna','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlarini tekshirish hamda litsenziyangiz haqiqiyligini tasdiqlash uchun vaqti-vaqti bilan %2$sga muhim litsenziya ma\'lumotlarini yuborib turadi.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%2$s dan %1$s mavjud.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Oʻrnatilgan plaginlar va mavzularingiz bilan moslikni ta\'minlash va ziddiyatlarning oldini olish uchun.','Trial'=>'Sinov muddati','View %s State'=>'%s holatini koʻrish','View Basic %s Info'=>'Asosiy %s maʼlumotlarini koʻrish','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ha, %2$s sinov, bosqichma-bosqich sinov yoki ishlab chiqish maqsadida %4$s nusxasi hisoblanadi.','You have a %s license.'=>'Sizda %s litsenziya mavjud.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Siz %s litsenziyasini sotib oldingiz.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Sizning elektron pochtangizga (%2$s) %1$s boʻyicha tasdiqlash xati kelishi kerak. %3$s uchun ushbu xatdagi tugmani bosganingizga ishonch hosil qiling.','days'=>'kun','deactivating'=>'faoliyatsizlashtirilmoqda','hour'=>'soat','hours'=>'soatlar','license'=>'litsenziya','optional'=>'ixtiyoriy','products'=>'Mahsulotlar','skip'=>'o‘tkazib yuborish','subscription'=>'obuna','trial'=>'Sinov muddati','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Mahsulotlar','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','as software licenseLicense'=>'Litsenziya','close a windowDismiss'=>'Bekor qilish','close windowDismiss'=>'Rad etish','like websitesSites'=>'Saytlar','nounPricing'=>'Narxlar','trial periodTrial'=>'Sinov muddati','verbOpt In'=>'Obuna boʻlish','verbOpt Out'=>'Voz kechish','verbSkip'=>'O‘tkazib yuborish','verbUpgrade'=>'Yangilash','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s oldin','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Amalni bajarib bo\'lmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko\'ring, agar xatolik takrorlanaversa, sayt administratoriga murojaat qiling.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Kerakli qiymat yo\'q yoki noto\'g\'ri shaklda. Funksiyaning kirish sxemasini tekshiring.','The site refused the request.'=>'Sayt so\'rovni rad etdi.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt agentlari (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Claude, Cursor yoki VS Code kabi sun\'iy intellekt yordamchilariga MCP (Model Context Protocol) orqali ushbu saytda ishlashiga ruxsat bering. Ular ilova parolidan foydalangan holda WordPress foydalanuvchisi sifatida tizimga kiradi va faqat o‘sha foydalanuvchiga ruxsat etilgan amallarni bajarishi mumkin.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt agentlari uchun WordPress 6.9 yoki undan keyingi versiya talab qilinadi. Ulardan foydalanish uchun WordPress\'ni yangilang.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt agentlariga ruxsat berish (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Oʻchirilgan: quyidagi vositalar va ularning REST marshrutlari umuman roʻyxatdan oʻtmagan.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Ulanish manzili (MCP yakuniy nuqtasi)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Foydalanuvchingiz uchun dastur parolini yarating','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Buni foydalanuvchi nomingiz va ushbu parol bilan birga AI ilovangizning MCP sozlamalariga qo\'shing:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: bir xil yozuvni "mcpServers" ostiga emas, balki .vscode/mcp.json faylidagi "servers" ostiga qo\'ying.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Bu yerda sun\'iy intellekt agenti foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan vositalar (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasi: AI agentlari va MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dasturchi hujjatlari: imkoniyatlar, REST va MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich bo‘limlari va veb-sayt to‘plamlari yordamida ushbu sayt sahifalarini yarating va tahrirlang.','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'Sahifalar, bo‘limlar va veb-sayt to‘plamlari.','List pages'=>'Sahifalarni ro‘yxati','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'Tahrirlashingiz mumkin bo\'lgan sahifalarni eng yangisidan boshlab, ixtiyoriy qidiruv bilan ro\'yxatlaydi.','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'Sarlavha va tarkibdan qidiriladigan so\'zlar.','Read a page'=>'Sahifani oʻqish','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'Sahifaning sarlavhasi, holati, havolalari va blok tarkibini hamda u tuzilgan bo‘limlarni (yuqori darajadagi bloklarni) qaytaradi.','Create a page'=>'Sahifa yaratish','Creates a page from sections (see pbs/list-sections) and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Bo‘limlar (pbs/list-sections ga qarang) va/yoki blok kontentidan sahifa yaratadi. Boshqa holat so‘ralmagan bo‘lsa, yangi sahifa qoralama hisoblanadi.','Update a page'=>'Sahifani yangilash','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'Sahifaning sarlavhasi, holati yoki blok tarkibini o\'zgartiradi. Siz yuborgan tarkib sahifa tarkibining o\'rnini egallaydi.','List sections'=>'Bo\'limlarni ro\'yxat qilish','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'Sahifaga qo‘shish mumkin bo‘lgan tayyor bo‘limlarni (banner, funksiyalar, FAQ, sharhlar, harakatga chaqiruv va boshqalar) ro‘yxatga oladi.','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'Bo\'lim nomi yoki kalit so\'zlarda mos kelishi kerak bo\'lgan so\'zlar.','Add a section to a page'=>'Sahifaga bo\'lim qo\'shish','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'Sahifaga tayyor bo\'limni qo\'shadi: boshiga, oxiriga yoki berilgan pozitsiyadagi bo\'limdan keyin.','A section name from pbs/list-sections.'=>'pbs/list-sections bo\'limining nomi.','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'"after" pozitsiyasi bilan: keyin kiritiladigan bo\'limning 0 dan boshlanadigan pozitsiyasi.','List website kits'=>'Veb-sayt to‘plamlarini ro‘yxatga olish','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'Ushbu sayt import qilishi mumkin bo\'lgan veb-sayt to\'plamlarini (bir turdagi biznes uchun tayyor sahifalar to\'plami) ro\'yxatga oladi.','Import a website kit'=>'Veb-sayt to‘plamini import qilish','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'Veb-sayt to‘plamining sahifalarini (barchasini yoki nomlanganlarini) import qiladi, ixtiyoriy ravishda ularni chop etadi, bosh sahifani o‘rnatadi va menyuga qo‘shadi. Qayta import qilish o‘sha sahifalarni yangilaydi.','List the builder blocks'=>'Konstruktor bloklarini ro‘yxatga olish','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description. Use pbs/get-block for a block\'s settings, then put the block in a page\'s content.'=>'Ushbu sayt foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan barcha Page Builder Sandwich bloklarini ro\'yxatga oladi (Pro faol bo\'lganda Pro bloklari ham): nomi, sarlavhasi, toifasi va tavsifi. Blok sozlamalari uchun pbs/get-block\'dan foydalaning, so\'ngra blokni sahifa tarkibiga qo\'ying.','Describe a builder block'=>'Konstruktor blokini tavsiflash','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'Bitta blok sozlamalarini (ularning turlari, variantlari va standart qiymatlari bilan birga atributlar), u nimalarni qo\'llab-quvvatlashini, qaysi bloklarni o\'z ichiga olishi mumkinligini va blok belgilash tilidagi foydalanishga tayyor namunani qaytaradi.','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), as pbs/get-page lists them.'=>'Blok qayerda joylashgani: sahifa bo‘limlari orasidagi o‘rni, so‘ngra o‘sha blokning ichki bloklari orasidagi o‘rni va hokazo (0 dan boshlab), pbs/get-page ularni qanday keltirgan bo‘lsa.','Change one block\'s settings'=>'Bitta blok sozlamalarini o\'zgartirish','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; for a block whose HTML is saved in the page, send new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'Sahifa ichidagi bitta blokning sozlamalarini (atributlarini) yo\'li bo\'yicha topib o\'zgartiradi; yuborilgan atributlar joriy atributlar bilan birlashtiriladi. Sayt sozlamalaridan render qiladigan bloklarda ishlaydi; HTML\'i sahifada saqlanadigan blok uchun pbs/update-page yordamida yangi matn (markup) yuboring.','Remove a block from a page'=>'Sahifadan blokni olib tashlash','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'Sahifadan yo\'li bo\'yicha topilgan bitta blokni (butun bo\'limni yoki uning ichidagi blokni) olib tashlaydi. Sahifaning oldingi versiyasi uning tahrirlarida saqlanib qoladi.','Move a section'=>'Bo\'limni ko\'chirish','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, as pbs/get-page lists them).'=>'Sahifa bo‘limini bir pozitsiyadan boshqasiga ko‘chiradi (pbs/get-page ko‘rsatganidek, 0 dan boshlanadi).','Duplicate a page'=>'Sahifani nusxalash','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'Sahifani (sarlavhasi, mazmuni va shablonini) yangi qoralamaga nusxalaydi.','Move a page to the trash'=>'Sahifani chiqindiga ko\'chirish','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'Sahifani chiqindiga o\'tkazadi. Uni 30 kun davomida Sahifalar, Chiqindi bo\'limidan tiklash mumkin.','Build a landing page'=>'Lendi-sahifa yaratish','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'Bosqichma-bosqich jarayon: agent biznesingizga mos bo\'lgan bo\'limlarni tanlaydi, sahifani qoralama shaklida yaratadi va uning matnini yozadi.','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'Biznes, uning taklifi va auditoriyasi.','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'Sahifa qoralama, ko\'rib chiqish kutilmoqda, e\'lon qilingan yoki shaxsiy bo\'lishi mumkin.','Give the page a title.'=>'Sahifaga sarlavha bering.','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s oʻz HTML kodini sahifada saqlaydi, shuning uchun uning sozlamalarini alohida oʻzgartirib boʻlmaydi. Sahifaning yangi markup qismini pbs/update-page yordamida yuboring.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (nusxasi)','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Sahifani savatchaga ko\'chirib bo\'lmadi.','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'Ushbu WordPress saytida %s uchun landin sahifa yarating. Qadamlar: 1) pbs-list-sections\'ni chaqiring va oqilona tartibda 4 tadan 6 tagacha bo\'limni tanlang (bosh qism birinchi, harakatga chaqiruv oxirida); 2) pbs-create-page\'ni sarlavha va shu bo\'limlar bilan qoralama sifatida chaqiring; 3) pbs-get-page\'ni chaqiring va pbs-update-page yordamida ushbu biznes uchun har bir to\'ldiruvchi matnni qayta yozing (har bir blok izohi va tegini o\'z holida saqlang); 4) agar pbs-generate-page mavjud bo\'lsa, 1-3-qadamlar o\'rniga undan foydalanishingiz mumkin; 5) sahifaning tahrirlash havolasini xabar qiling va so\'ramasdan uni chop etmang.','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'Bu pozitsiyada blok yo\'q. Avval sahifani pbs/get-page yordamida o\'qing.','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'"%s" deb nomlangan blok mavjud emas. pbs/list-blocks sahifasiga qarang.','The page has no section at that position.'=>'Ushbu pozitsiyada sahifaning boʻlimi yoʻq.','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'Bu to\'plam nomi emas. pbs/list-kits\'ni ko\'ring.','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'"%s" nomli bo\'lim mavjud emas. pbs/list-sections sahifasiga qarang.','Section names from pbs/list-sections, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'Sahifa tartibidagi pbs/list-sections bo\'lim nomlari. Ular taqdim etilgan har qanday tarkibdan oldin keladi.','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'Blok belgilari (blok muharriri saqlaydigan format).','There is no page with that ID.'=>'Bunday ID raqamiga ega sahifa mavjud emas.','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'Sizga bu sahifada bunday qilishga ruxsat etilmagan.','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'Adobe Fonts (Pro) ulanishi','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'Adobe Fonts (Typekit) veb-loyihasini kit id orqali ulaydi, shunda uning shriftlari shrift tanlagichlarda ko‘rinadi.','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Brend to\'plamini o\'zgartirish (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'Brend to\'plamini saqlaydi: nomi, logotipi, ranglari, sarlavha va matn shriftlari hamda sun\'iy intellekt yozishda foydalanadigan brend ovozi.','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Brend to‘plamini qo‘llash (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'Saqlangan brend to‘plamining ranglari va shriftlarini sayt dizayniga qo‘llaydi.','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'Moslashuvchan nuqtalarni o\'qish','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'Moslashuvchan boshqaruv elementlari foydalanadigan planshet va mobil qurilmalar kengliklarini (va Pro-dagi maxsus nuqtalarni) qaytaradi.','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'Moslashuvchan nuqtalarni o\'zgartirish','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'Planshet va mobil qurilmalar kengligini piksellarda o‘zgartiradi; Pro versiyasida esa maxsus qo‘shimcha nuqtalar mavjud.','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'Global klass yaratish (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'Qayta foydalanish mumkin bo\'lgan global uslublar sinfini yaratadi: yorliq, slug va uning uslublari (s).','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'Global klassni o\'chirish (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Global klassni o\'chiradi. Undan foydalangan elementlar o\'z kontentini saqlab qoladi va uslublarini yo\'qotadi.','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'Global klassni o‘zgartirish (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'Global klass yorligʻi, slug yoki uslublarini oʻzgartiradi; undan foydalanadigan har bir element yangilanadi.','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'Global klassni nusxalash (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'Global klassni yangi id ostidan nusxalaydi.','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Yuklangan shriftni yoqish (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'Yuklangan maxsus shriftni (media kutubxonasidagi shrift fayli, id bo\'yicha) shrift tanlash vositalarida foydalanish mumkin qiladi.','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Yuklangan shriftni o\'chirish (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'Shrift tanlagichlardan maxsus shriftni (slug bo\'yicha) olib tashlaydi.','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'Qorong‘i rejimidagi o‘zgarish (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'Qorong‘i rejimni (rejim: off, auto yoki toggle) va uning ranglarini sozlaydi.','Read the site design'=>'Sayt dizaynini o\'qish','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'Sayt dizayni ekranida ko‘rsatilgandek, har bir blok foydalanadigan sayt bo‘ylab ranglar va shriftlarni (sarlavha va asosiy matn) qaytaradi.','Change the site design'=>'Sayt dizaynini o\'zgartirish','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'Sayt miqyosidagi ranglarni (colors), shriftlarni (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont) o\'zgartiradi. Har bir sahifa o\'zgarishni qabul qiladi; temasining theme.json fayli sinxron holatda saqlanadi.','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'Dizayn tizimini o‘qish (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'Pro dizayn tizimini qaytaradi: global sinflar, o\'zgaruvchilar, dizayn tokenlari, qorong\'i rejim, brend to\'plami va maxsus shriftlar.','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'Dizayn tokenlarini o\'zgartirish (Pro)','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'Oraliq, radius va soyalar masshtablarini (space, radius, shadow) o\'zgartiradi yoki ularni asl holatiga qaytaradi (reset).','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'CSS o\'zgaruvchilarini o\'zgartirish (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'Saytning dizayn o\'zgaruvchilarini almashtiradi (o\'zgaruvchilar: nom va qiymatlar ro\'yxati).','List the dynamic content sources (Pro)'=>'Dinamik kontent manbalarini ro\'yxatga olish (Pro)','Returns what a block can be filled from (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) with each source\'s fields, the field plugins on this site (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) and a post type\'s fields (postType). Bind a block with pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.'=>'Blok nimadan to\'ldirilishi mumkinligini (post, muallif, sayt, arxiv, maxsus maydon, mahsulot) har bir manbaning maydonlari, ushbu saytdagi maydon plaginlari (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) va post turi maydonlari (postType) bilan birga qaytaradi. Blokni pbs/update-block orqali ulang: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.','Preview a dynamic value (Pro)'=>'Dinamik qiymatni oldindan ko\'rish (Pro)','Returns what a binding shows on one post (post, source, and field or provider + key, as text|url), to check a binding before or after adding it.'=>'Bog‘lanishni qo‘shishdan oldin yoki keyin uni tekshirish uchun bog‘lanish bitta postda nimani ko‘rsatishini (post, manba va maydon yoki provayder + kalit, matn|url sifatida) qaytaradi.','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'Oʻz-oʻzida joylashtirilgan shriftni olib tashlash','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'O\'z-o\'zidan xost qilingan shriftlar oilasining fayllarini o\'chiradi.','List self-hosted fonts'=>'Oʻz-oʻzida joylashtirilgan shriftlarni roʻyxatga olish','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'Ushbu sayt o\'zida saqlaydigan Google shriftlarini ro\'yxatga oladi (bir marta yuklab olingan, saytdan taqdim etiladi, Google\'ga so\'rov yuborilmaydi).','Self-host a font'=>'Shriftni o\'zingizda joylashtiring','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'Google shrift oilasini (family, weights, italic) yuklab oladi va uni ushbu saytdan taqdim etadi.','List forms'=>'Formalar roʻyxati','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'Form bloki yordamida yaratilgan formalarni va u o\'rnatishi mumkin bo\'lgan forma plaginlarini sanab o\'tadi.','List uploaded icons'=>'Yuklangan ikonkalarni ro‘yxatga olish','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'Belgilangan belgilar kutubxonasiga yuklangan SVG ikonkalarni eng yangisidan boshlab ro\'yxatlaydi.','Upload an icon'=>'Nishonchani yuklash','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'SVG ikonkachasini (nomi, svg belgisi) ikonka kutubxonasiga qo\'shadi; SVG avval tozalanadi.','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'Yuklangan belgini o‘chirish','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'Yuklangan belgini o\'chirib tashlaydi; undan foydalangan bloklar o\'z nusxasini saqlab qoladi.','Read the licence'=>'Litsenziyani o‘qish','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Bu saytning Page Builder Sandwich rejimini, litsenziya holatini, yangilash sanasini va rejaga nimalar kirishini qaytaradi.','Revoke temporary support logins'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash loginlarini bekor qilish','Removes temporary support users now (ids).'=>'Vaqtincha qo\'llab-quvvatlash foydalanuvchilarini hozir o\'chiradi (idlar).','List temporary support logins'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash loginlarini ro‘yxatga olish','Lists the temporary support users granted to our team and when each expires.'=>'Bizning jamoamizga berilgan vaqtinchalik qo\'llab-quvvatlash foydalanuvchilarini va ularning har biri qachon tugashini sanab o\'tadi.','Disconnect from support'=>'Yordamdan uzilish','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Bu saytni qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatidan uzadi.','Read the support connection'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash ulanishini o‘qish','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Ushbu sayt Zinn Digital® qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulanganmi yoki yo\'qmi va kim sifatida ulanganini ko\'rsatadi.','Connect to support'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulanish','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Bu saytni Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulaydi (ism, elektron pochta, rozilik).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Texnik yordam diagnostikasiga rozilik berish','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash so‘rovlari bilan diagnostika ma\'lumotlarini yuborish uchun ma\'mur roziligini qayd etadi.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Sayt diagnostikasini o\'qish','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash to‘chati o‘zida mujassam etadigan diagnostika ma’lumotlarini qaytaradi: versiyalar, faol plaginlar, cheklovlar va so‘nggi xatolar.','Open a support ticket'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat ochish','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email) with this site\'s diagnostics; access_days and credentials optionally grant our team temporary access.'=>'Ushbu sayt diagnostikasi bilan qo‘llab-quvvatlash so‘rovini (mavzu, xabar, tur, elektron pochta) yaratadi; access_days va hisob ma\'lumotlari ixtiyoriy ravishda jamoamizga vaqtinchalik kirish huquqini beradi.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Bepul Pro sinov muddatini boshlash','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Ushbu sayt uchun Page Builder Sandwich Pro 14 kunlik sinov muddatini boshlaydi (to‘lov talab qilinmaydi).','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'Bulut kutubxonasi hisobini o\'qish (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'Bulut kutubxonasidan foydalanilgan xotira hajmi, tarif kvotasi va jamoa ma\'lumotlarini qaytaradi.','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'Bulutli kutubxona dizaynlarini ro\'yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'Bulut kutubxonasida saqlangan dizaynlarni ro\'yxatga oladi (turi: bo\'lim, sahifa yoki naqsh; jamoa: jamoaning kutubxonasi).','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'Dizaynni bulutli kutubxonaga saqlash (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'Blokni belgilashni (sarlavha, tur, belgilash, uslublar, teglar) bulutli kutubxonangizga yoki jamoa kutubxonasiga saqlaydi; rasmlar unga qo\'shib qadoqlanadi.','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Bulutli kutubxona dizaynini o\'chirish (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'Bulut kutubxonasidan dizaynni o\'chiradi.','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Bulutli kutubxona dizaynini olish (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'Ushbu saytga joylashtirishga tayyor bitta saqlangan dizaynni qaytaradi (uning rasmlari media kutubxonasiga kiritilgan).','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'Jamoani tark etish (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'Ushbu sayt qo\'shilgan jamoat kutubxonasini tark etadi.','Join a team (Pro)'=>'Jamoaga qo\'shilish (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'Taklif kodi yordamida jamoa kutubxonasiga qo\'shiladi.','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'O\'z xotirangizdan foydalanishni to\'xtating (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'Oʻzingizning xotira sozlamalaringizni olib tashlaydi; tarif boʻyicha xotira yana ishlatila boshlaydi.','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'O\'z-o\'zidan saqlash sozlamalarini o\'qish (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'O\'zingizning R2/S3 xotira sozlamalaringizni qaytaradi (maxfiy kalit hech qachon qaytarilmaydi).','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'O\'z xotirangizdan foydalaning (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'O\'z xotirabangizdan foydalanishni saqlaydi: provayder (r2 yoki s3), baket, mintaqa, yakuniy nuqta (endpoint), prefiks, key_id, secret, yoqilgan.','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'O\'z xotirangizni sinab ko\'ring (Pro)','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'O\'z xotirangizda sinov obyektini yozadi, o\'qiydi va o\'chiradi hamda har bir qadam haqida xabar beradi.','List library teams (Pro)'=>'Kutubxona jamoalarini ro\'yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'Ushbu sayt tegishli bo\'lgan yoki unga egalik qiladigan jamoalarni ro\'yxatlaydi.','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'Kutubxona jamoasini (Agentlik) yaratish','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'Boshqa saytlar taklifnoma kodi orqali qo\'shilishi mumkin bo\'lgan jamoaviy kutubxona (name) yaratadi.','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'Kutubxona jamoasini o\'chirish (Agentlik)','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'Jamoani va uning kutubxonasidagi barcha dizaynlarni oʻchirib yuboradi.','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'Jamoaga sayt taklif qilish (Agentlik)','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'Bir martalik taklif kodini yaratadi (rol: o\'qish yoki yozish; yorliq; amal qilish muddati: kunlar). Kod bir marta ko\'rsatiladi.','List team members (Pro)'=>'Jamoa a\'zolarini ro\'yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'Jamoadagi saytlar va ularning kirish huquqlarini ro\'yxatga oladi.','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'Jamoa a\'zosini o\'chirish (Agentlik)','Removes a site from a team.'=>'Saytdan jamoani olib tashlaydi.','Add a query loop (Pro)'=>'So‘rov siklini qo‘shish (Pro)','Adds a query loop with a ready-made card, on a new page (pageTitle, status) or at the end of a post (post): source posts|users|terms|field, postType (product for a shop grid), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, and live filters [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].'=>'Yangi sahifada (pageTitle, status) yoki post oxirida (post) tayyor kartochka bilan so‘rovlar siklini qo‘shadi: source posts|users|terms|field, postType (doʻkon panjarasi uchun product), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination va jonli filtrlar [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'Lottie animatsiyalar ro\'yxati (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'Yuklangan Lottie animatsiyalarini roʻyxatga oladi.','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'Lottie animatsiyasini yuklash (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'Lottie JSON hujjati (json, name) ni tasdiqlaydi va uni Lottie bloki uchun statik fayl sifatida e\'lon qiladi.','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'A/B testlarni va ularning natijalarini ro\'yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'Har bir versiyaning tashrif buyuruvchilari va konversiyalari hamda qaysi biri g‘alaba qozonayotgani ko‘rsatilgan A/B testlar ro‘yxatini tuzadi.','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'A/B sinovini yaratish (Pro)','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'Bo\'limning ikki versiyasini sinab ko\'rishni xabar oxiriga qo\'shadi (post, name, a, b; bo\'lish va maqsad ixtiyoriy).','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'A/B test natijalarini tiklash (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'Sinov hisoblarini tozalaydi va uni qaytadan boshlaydi (test).','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'Pochta ro\'yxati ulanishlarini ro\'yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'Pochta roʻyxati xizmatlari (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) va ulardan qaysilari ulanganligini sanab oʻtadi. Kalitlar hech qachon qaytarilmaydi.','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'Pochta roʻyxati xizmatini ulash (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'Pochta ro\'yxati xizmatini uning API kaliti bilan bog\'laydi (xizmat, kalit; xizmat bittasini talab qiladigan hisob) yoki bo\'sh kalit yordamida uzib qo\'yadi.','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'Xizmatning pochta ro\'yxatlarini ko\'rsatish (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'Formaning obuna boʻlish amakati uchun ulangan xat tarqatish xizmatining auditoriyalari yoki roʻyxatlarini sanab oʻtadi.','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Cookie rozilligi bannerini o\'qish (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'Rozet bannerini qaytaradi: u yoqilganmi, uning matni va dizayni, toifalar va u qayerda qo\'llanilishi.','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Cookie rozchilik bannerini o‘zgartirish (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'Rozilik bannerini o‘zgartiradi. U yoqilgan vaqtda kuzatuv skriptlari tashrif buyuruvchining roziligini kutadi.','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'Boshlang\'ich cookie bannerini yaratish (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'Boshlash uchun tayyor rozilik banneri dizaynini yaratadi.','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'Form-builder shakllarini ro\'yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'Form builder yordamida yaratilgan har bir ro‘yxatni ko‘rsatadi: u joylashgan sahifa, uning maydonlari va yuborilganda nima sodir bo‘lishi.','Create a form (Pro)'=>'Forma yaratish (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'Yangi sahifada yoki mavjud xabarning (postning) oxirida forma (kontakt, narx so‘rovi, ro‘yxatdan o‘tish yoki ko‘p bosqichli: maydonlar, qadamlar, sozlamalar va elektron pochta, saqlash, veb-huk yoki pochta ro‘yxati kabi amallar) yaratadi.','Change a form (Pro)'=>'Shaklni o\'zgartirish (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'Bitta shaklni o\'zgartirish (post, shakl): sozlamalar va harakatlar mavjudlari bilan birlashadi; maydonlar (va qadamlar) maydonlarni almashtiradi.','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'Animatsiya va oʻzaro taʼsir sozlamalarini roʻyxatlash (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'Saytdagi har bir harakat sozlamasini (kirish animatsiyasi, uning davomiyligi va kechikishi, aylantirish effekti, sichqoncha belgisi ostidagi effekt, ko‘rinishda qolish, parallaks, ko‘rsatkichga ergashish) o‘z tanlovlari yoki diapazoni va saytning nuqtalari bilan qaytaradi.','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'Blokni animatsiya qilish (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Sahifa blokining harakat sozlamalarini (null qiymatiga) o\'rnatadi yoki olib tashlaydi; blok o\'z yo\'li orqali va brakpoynt (standart bo\'yicha bazaviy) bo\'yicha topiladi. Sahifada HTML-kodi saqlanadigan yadro bloklari hamkorligida istalgan blokda ishlaydi. Harakatni kamaytirishni so\'ragan tashrif buyuruvchilar hech qachon harakatni ko\'rmaydilar.','List the popups (Pro)'=>'Popuplar ro\'yxati (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'Popaplar, slayd-inlar va panellarni ularning ishga tushirish mexanizmlari, chastota qoidalari va qayerda ko‘rsatilishi bilan birga ro‘yxatlaydi.','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'Pop-ap yaratish (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'Qalqib chiquvchi oyna, surilib kiruvchi element yoki panel yaratadi: uning tarkibi, ishga tushirish sharti (chiqish niyati, aylantirish, vaqt, bosish), chastotasi va ko‘rsatiladigan sahifalari.','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'Popapni o‘zgartirish (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'(id) bo\'yicha ochiladigan oyna, slayder yoki panelni o\'zgartiradi: tarkib, ishga tushiruvchi, chastota yoki qayerda ko\'rsatilishi.','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'Formga yuborilgan javoblarni o\'qish (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar ma\'lumotlarni saqlash shakllari (shakl uni toraytiradi) orqali yuborgan narsalarni bir vaqtning o\'zida bitta sahifadan ro\'yxatlaydi.','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Konversiyalarni kuzatishni o‘qish (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager va Meta Pixel sozlamalarini hamda qaysi bosishlar va forma yuborishlari yuborilishini qaytaradi.','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Konversiyani kuzatishni oʻzgartirish (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager va Meta Pixel sozlamalarini va qaysi voqealar yuborilishini oʻzgartiradi.','Read the legacy migration'=>'Eski migratsiyani o\'qish','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'5.x tarkibini o\'tkazish jarayoni va hisobotini qaytaradi.','Convert legacy content'=>'Eski tarkibni oʻtkazish','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'Har bir 5.x sahifani bloklarga o\'tkazishni boshlaydi (yoki qayta boshlaydi); har bir post avval zaxiralanadi.','Undo the legacy migration'=>'Eski migratsiyani bekor qilish','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'Har bir o\'tkazilgan xabarni o\'z zaxira nusxasidan tiklaydi.','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'Axborotnoma ulanishini o\'qish (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'Mailchimp kaliti saqlanganligini bildiradi (kalitning o\'zi hech qachon qaytarilmaydi).','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'Mailchimp-ni ulash (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'Axborotnoma bloki foydalanadigan Mailchimp API kalitini saqlaydi (yoki bo\'sh qiymat bilan olib tashlaydi).','Convert one legacy page'=>'Bitta eski sahifani aylantirish','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'5.x formatidagi bitta sahifani bloklarga o\'tkazadi (avval zaxirasi nusxalanadi).','Undo one conversion'=>'Bitta o\'zgarishni bekor qilish','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'Zaxira nusxasidan bitta o\'zgartirilgan sahifani tiklaydi.','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Sharhlar manbalarini o\'qish (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'Sharhlar bloki ko\'rsatadigan Google va Trustpilot manbalarini qaytaradi.','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Sharhlar manbalarini o\'zgartirish (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'Sharhlar bloki o‘qiydigan Google joylashuvi va Trustpilot biznesini o‘rnatadi.','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'Sharhlarni hozir yangilash (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'Kundalik yangilanishni kutmasdan, eng so\'nggi Trustpilot sharhlarini hoziroq olib keladi.','Read the plugin settings'=>'Plagin sozlamalarini oʻqish','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Old-end sinf prefiksini, beta-yangilanishlar holatini va sun\'iy intellekt agentlariga (MCP) ruxsat berilganligini qaytaradi.','Change the plugin settings'=>'Plagin sozlamalarini o\'zgartirish','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'Oldnoma sinf prefiksini (harfdan boshlanadigan 1 tadan 8 tagacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlar) o\'zgartiradi va/yoki sun\'iy intellekt agentlarini (MCP) yoqadi yoki o\'chiradi (mcp: false barcha imkoniyatlar va MCP yakuniy nuqtasini olib tashlaydi).','Add a product block or mini cart (Pro)'=>'Mahsulot bloki yoki mini savatni qo\'shish (Pro)','Adds a WooCommerce block at the end of a post: a product element (part: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, or 0 for the product being viewed) or a mini cart (label).'=>'Post oxiriga WooCommerce blokini qo‘shadi: mahsulot elementi (qismi: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId yoki ko‘rsatilayotgan mahsulot uchun 0) yoki mini savat (label).','Read the theme builder\'s choices (Pro)'=>'Mavzu yaratuvchining tanlovlarini o\'qish (Pro)','Returns the template types, the display-condition kinds (page, post type, term, archive, search, 404, logged in, role, device, date, time, URL parameter, referrer, language, cart) with their choices on this site (roles, languages, post types, taxonomies), and the block attribute (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) that shows or hides any block — set it with pbs/update-block.'=>'Shu saytdagi tanlovlari (rollar, tillar, post turlari, taksonomiyalar) bilan birga shablon turlarini, ko‘rsatish sharti turlarini (sahifa, post turi, term, arxiv, qidiruv, 404, tizimga kirgan, rol, qurilma, sana, vaqt, URL parametri, referer, til, savat) hamda har qanday blokka ko‘rsatish yoki yashirish imkonini beruvchi blok atributini (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) qaytaradi — buni pbs/update-block yordamida o‘rnating.','List the theme templates (Pro)'=>'Mavzu shablonlarini ro‘yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the theme builder\'s templates (header, footer, single, archive, search, 404 and, with WooCommerce, product, shop, cart, checkout, thank-you and My Account): each one\'s type, where it shows (include/exclude rules), priority, status and blocks.'=>'Mavzu yaratuvchining shablonlarini (sarlavha, ostki qism, yagona, arxiv, qidiruv, 404 va WooCommerce bilan birga mahsulot, doʻkon, savat, buyurtma berish, minnatdorchilik va Mening hisobim): ularning har birining turi, qayerda koʻrsatilishi (kiritish/istisno qoidalari), ustuvorligi, holati va bloklarini roʻyxatlaydi.','Create a theme template (Pro)'=>'Mavzu shablonini yaratish (Pro)','Creates a template (title, type) that replaces that part of every matching page, on classic and block themes. Without content it starts from a ready-made design for its type. include/exclude are display-condition rules ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; see pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority breaks ties; status publish (live) or draft.'=>'Klassik va blok mavzularda mos keladigan har bir sahifaning o\'sha qismini almashtiradigan shablon (sarlavha, tur) yaratadi. Kontentsiz u o\'z turi uchun tayyor dizayndan boshlanadi. include/exclude – bu ko\'rsatish sharti qoidalari ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; pbs/get-theme-builder-options\'ga qarang); ustunlik tengliklarni hal qiladi; status publish (faol) yoki draft (qoralama).','Delete a theme template (Pro)'=>'Mavzu shablonini oʻchirish (Pro)','Moves one template (id) to the trash; the theme\'s own design shows again where it applied. Restorable from the trash.'=>'Bitta shablonni (id) savatga ko‘chiradi; u qo‘llanilgan joyda yana mavzuning o‘z dizayni ko‘rsatiladi. Savatdan tiklash mumkin.','Change a theme template (Pro)'=>'Mavzu shablonini o\'zgartirish (Pro)','Changes one template (id): any of title, type, content (block markup), include, exclude, priority, status. Only what you send changes.'=>'Bitta shablonni o\'zgartirish (id): sarlavha, tur, tarkib (blok belgisi), kiritish, chiqarib tashlash, ustuvorlik, holatdan istal biri. Faqat yuborgan narsangiz o\'zgaradi.','Export designs and settings'=>'Dizayn va sozlamalarni eksport qilish','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'Tanlangan shablonlar va naqshlarni (id\'lar) va ixtiyoriy ravishda sozlamalarni boshqa sayt uchun bitta paket sifatida eksport qiladi.','Import designs and settings'=>'Dizayn va sozlamalarni import qilish','Imports a package made by pbs/export-designs (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'pbs/export-designs tomonidan tayyorlangan paketni import qiladi (nima o\'zgarishini ko\'rish uchun oldindan dryRun; mode: skip yoki replace; media; sozlamalar).','List what can be exported'=>'Nimalarni eksport qilish mumkinligini ro\'yxatga olish','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'Boshqa saytga eksport qilinishi mumkin bo\'lgan shablonlar, namunalar va sozlamalarni ro\'yxatlaydi.','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Texnik xizmat koʻrsatish rejimini oʻqish (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'Saytga texnik xizmat koʻrsatish / tez kunda rejimi: rejim, sahifa, qayta urinish va qaysi rollar saytni koʻrishda davom etishi.','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Texnik xizmat koʻrsatish rejimini oʻzgartirish (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'Texnik xizmat ko\'rsatish (503) yoki tez orada ishga tushish rejimini yoqadi yoki o\'chiradi (mode), ko\'rsatiladigan sahifa (page_id), retry_after va uni chetlab o\'tadigan rollar bilan birga.','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'Topish va almashtirish vazifalarini ro‘yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'Sayt bo‘ylab qidirib-almashtirish vazifalarini va ularning holatini ro‘yxatga oladi.','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'Sayt bo\'ylab qidirish va almashtirish (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until pbs/apply-replace.'=>'Blok xavfsiz topish va almashtirishni boshlaydi (topish, almashtirish, turi: matn, havola yoki rang; match_case; turlari). pbs/apply-replace bajarilmaguncha hech narsa o\'zgarmaydi.','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Qidirish va almashtirishni ko\'rib chiqish (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'Ariza topshirishdan oldin ko\'rib chiqish uchun ish o\'rinlarining mos kelishlarini sahifama-sahifa qaytaradi.','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Topish va almashtirishni qo\'llash (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup for pbs/undo-replace.'=>'Oldindan ko‘rilgan ishni amalga oshiradi. O‘zgartirilgan har bir post pbs/undo-replace uchun zaxira nusxasini saqlaydi.','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Topish va almashtirishni bekor qilish (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'Ish o\'zgartirgan xabarlarni tiklaydi (o\'zgartirilganidan beri tahrirlangan xabar o\'z tahririni saqlab qoladi).','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Konstruktor huquqlarini o\'qish (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'Qaysi rollar tuzuvchi, dizayn, kod va shablondan (mijoz rejimi) foydalanishi mumkinligini qaytaradi.','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Konstruktor ruxsatlarini o‘zgartirish (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only client role.'=>'Har bir rol uchun konstruktor nimalarga ruxsat berishini belgilaydi (rollar), masalan, faqat kontent bilan ishlovchi mijoz roli.','Read white label (Agency)'=>'Oq yorliqli (Agentlik) o\'qish','Returns the white-label settings: on or off, the name shown and which users still see the original.'=>'Oq-yorliq sozlamalarini qaytaradi: yoqilgan yoki o\'chirilgan, ko\'rsatiladigan nom va qaysi foydalanuvchilar hali ham asl nusxasini ko\'rishi.','Change white label (Agency)'=>'Oq yorliqdni o\'zgartirish (Agentlik)','Turns white label on or off and sets the name clients see (enabled, name, agency_users).'=>'Oq yorliqdagi brendlashni yoqadi yoki o‘chiradi hamda mijozlar ko‘radigan nomni belgilaydi (enabled, name, agency_users).','Build several pages'=>'Bir nechta sahifa yaratish','Creates up to 50 pages in one call, each from sections and/or block content. Each page is checked and created on its own; the answer lists every page made and every one refused, with the reason.'=>'Bir so‘rovda bo‘limlar va/yoki blok kontentidan foydalangan holda 50 tagacha sahifa yaratadi. Har bir sahifa alohida tekshiriladi va yaratiladi; javobda yaratilgan va rad etilgan har bir sahifa sababi bilan birga keltiriladi.','Write a page with AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt yordamida sahifa yozish','Builds a page from sections (given, or chosen by AI from the section library) and has AI rewrite all of its text for your brief, keeping the design. Uses the AI provider set up in the plugin\'s AI settings. The page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Bo\'limlardan (taqdim etilgan yoki AI tomonidan bo\'limlar kutubxonasidan tanlangan) sahifa yaratadi va dizaynni saqlab qolgan holda, AI yordamida uning barcha matnini sizning talabingizga ko\'ra qayta yozadi. Plaginning AI sozlamalarida o\'rnatilgan AI provayderidan foydalanadi. Agar boshqa holat so\'ralmagan bo\'lsa, sahifa qoralama hisoblanadi.','What the page is for: the business, the offer, the audience and the tone.'=>'Sahifa nima uchun mo\'ljallangan: biznes, taklif, auditoriya va ohang.','Send between 1 and %d pages.'=>'1 dan %d tagacha sahifa yuboring.','AI is not available in this build.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt ushbu versiyada mavjud emas.','Describe the page in at least a sentence.'=>'Sahifani kamida bitta jumla bilan tavsiflang.','The AI did not choose any section from the library. Name the sections yourself, or try a more detailed brief.'=>'SUN Sun\'iy intellekt kutubxonadan hech qanday bo\'limni tanlamadi. Bo\'limlarni o\'zingiz nomlang yoki batafsilroq topshiriqni sinab ko\'ring.','The AI rewrote %1$d of the page\'s %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was saved. Try again.'=>'SUN\'iy intellekt sahifadagi %2$d ta matn parchasidan %1$d tasini qayta yozdi, shuning uchun hech narsa saqlanmadi. Qayta urinib ko\'ring.','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovi bajarilmadi. Qayta urinib ko\'ring.','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Hozirda migratsiya jarayoni bajarilmoqda. Bir daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','Rated %s out of 5'=>'5 tadan %s baholandi','Adults only: %d and over'=>'Faqat kattalar uchun: %d yosh va undan katta','Pros'=>'Afzalliklar','Cons'=>'Kamchiliklar','%1$s out of %2$s'=>'%1$s / %2$s','Claim offer'=>'Taklifni olish','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply.'=>'Faqat yangi mijozlar uchun. Shartlar va qoidalar amal qiladi.','Rank'=>'Daraja','Operator'=>'Operator','Bonus'=>'Bonus','Rating'=>'Baho','Highlights'=>'Muhim voqealar','Visit'=>'Tashrif buyurish','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply. Please gamble responsibly.'=>'Faqat yangi mijozlar uchun. Shartlar va qoidalar amal qiladi. Iltimos, mas\'uliyat bilan qimor o\'ynang.','%s in 24 hours'=>'24 соат ичида %s','Prices will appear here shortly.'=>'Narxlar tez orada bu yerda paydo bo\'ladi.','Prices from CoinGecko, updated %s'=>'CoinGecko narxlari, %s yangilangan','Cryptocurrency prices'=>'Kriptovalyuta narxlari','%1$s: %2$s, up %3$s%% in %4$d day'=>'%1$s: %2$