%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Bu sharh havolasi endi amal qilmaydi. Yangisini so\'rang.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Oxirgi bir soat ichida ushbu havoladan juda koʻp izohlar yuborildi. Keyinroq yana urinib koʻring.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Sizning rolingiz shablonlar yoki naqshlar yarata olmaydi.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'Siz ushbu sahifadagi matn va rasmlarni oʻzgartirishingiz mumkin, ammo uning tuzilishi yoki dizaynini emas. Oʻzgarishingiz saqlanmadi.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Sizning rolingiz uslublarni o\'zgartira olmaydi. Uslub o\'zgarishlarini bekor qiling va qaytadan saqlang.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Sizning rolingiz maxsus kodni (maxsus CSS yoki HTML bloklarini) qo\'sha olmaydi yoki o\'zgartira olmaydi. Ushbu o\'zgarishlarni bekor qiling va qaytadan saqlang.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Bu ushbu plagindan eksport qilingan fayl emas.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Bu eksport fayli plaginning yangi versiyasi yordamida yaratilgan. Ushbu saytdagi plaginni yangilang, so\'ngra uni qaytadan import qiling.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Eksport fayli shikastlangan: uning elementlar roʻyxati yoʻq.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Eksport qilingan fayl shikastlangan yoki yaratilgandan keyin tahrirlangan (uning nazorat yigʻindisi mos kelmaydi). Uni boshqa saytdan qaytadan eksport qiling.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'"%s" import qilinmadi: bu saytda bu turdagi element mavjud emas.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'“%s” import qilinmadi: bu turdagi elementni yaratishga ruxsatingiz yoʻq.','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'“%s” almashtirilmadi: bu saytdagisini tahrirlashga ruxsat berilmagan.','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'“%1$s” import qilinmadi: %2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'Sozlamalar import qilinmadi: ularni faqat administrator o\'zgartirishi mumkin.','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'%1$s rasmi nusxalanmadi: %2$s','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Umumiy koʻrinishda yashirin takliflarni qaytadan koʻrsatish','%d selected'=>'%d tasi tanlandi' . "\0" . '%d tasi tanlandi','Nothing matches.'=>'Hech narsa mos kelmadi.','Select all on this page'=>'Ushbu sahifadagi barchasini tanlash','Select'=>'Tanlash','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'%1$d-sahifa (%2$d tadan)','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'%s ni bir necha daqiqada sozlang','Start setup'=>'O‘rnatishni boshlash','This site'=>'Ushbu sayt','Edition'=>'Nashr','Sites on this licence'=>'Ushbu litsenziyadagi saytlar','Version'=>'Versiya','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Bu sinov yoki lokal nusxaga o‘xshaydi, shuning uchun u litsenziyangizdagi saytlar sonidan foydalanmaydi.','See what Pro adds'=>'Pro nima qo\'shishini ko\'ring','Go to'=>'O\'tish','Personal'=>'Shaxsiy','Business'=>'Biznes','Agency'=>'Agentlik','Any number of sites'=>'Istalgancha saytlar','Unlimited sites'=>'Cheklanmagan saytlar','%d site'=>'%d ta sayt' . "\0" . '%d ta sayt','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'%s sinov muddati','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Sizning sinov muddatingiz boshlandi. Barcha Pro funksiyalarini ko‘rish uchun sahifani qayta yuklang.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Sinov muddatini boshlab bo‘lmadi.','Feature'=>'Funksiya','Your licence'=>'Sizning litsenziyangiz','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%2$d tadan %1$d tasi foydalanilmoqda','Renews'=>'Yangilanadi','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Saytning sinov, test va lokal nusxalari bepul bo‘lib, hech qachon sayt limiti hisobiga kirmaydi.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Sizning rejangiz ustuvor qo\'llab-quvvatlashni o\'z ichiga oladi.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Litsenziyangiz va hisob-kitobingizni boshqaring','Get more with Pro'=>'Pro bilan ko\'proq oling','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Karta talab qilinmaydigan %d kunlik bepul sinov muddatini boshlang' . "\0" . 'Karta talab qilinmaydigan %d kunlik bepul sinov muddatini boshlang','See plans and prices'=>'Reja va narxlarni ko\'rish','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Tranzly va Page Builder Sandwich’ni birgalikda ishlatmoqchimisiz? To‘plam ikkala Pro plaginni ham arzonroq narxda o‘z ichiga oladi.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugadi. Yangilanishlar va Pro funksiyalarini olishda davom etish uchun uni yangilang.','Renew now'=>'Hozir yangilash','Compare the plans'=>'Rejalarni solishtirish','Search features'=>'Funksiyalarni qidirish','Area'=>'Hudud','Included in'=>'Quyidagilar kiritilgan:','No feature matches.'=>'Hech qanday funksiya mos kelmadi.','Features by plan'=>'Tarif bo\'yicha imkoniyatlar','Hide'=>'Yashirish','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Plaginlar ekranida uni faollashtiring','Install it'=>'Uni oʻrnatish','Overview'=>'Umumiy koʻrinish','Setup'=>'O‘rnatish','Plans and licence'=>'Rejalar va litsenziya','Add-ons'=>'Qo‘shimchalar','Feedback'=>'Fikr-mulohaza','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Tanlovingiz saqlanmadi.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'O\'rnatish holatini saqlab bo\'lmadi.','Match my computer'=>'Kompyuterim bilan moslashtirish','Light'=>'Yorugʻ','Dark'=>'To\'q rang','Colour scheme'=>'Rang sxemasi','Help'=>'Yordam','Guide to this screen'=>'Ushbu ekran bo\'yicha qo\'llanma','Take the tour'=>'Ekskursiyadan o‘tish','Get help or report a bug'=>'Yordam olish yoki xatolik haqida xabar berish','Plugin screens'=>'Plagin ekranlari','That could not be saved.'=>'Uni saqlab bo\'lmadi.','Before you contact support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qilishdan oldin','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'So\'rovingiz ushbu saytdan ushbu plaginni yaratuvchi %s ga yuborildi. Biz yuboramiz:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'javob bera olishimiz uchun elektron pochta manzilingiz va ismingiz;','the subject and message you write;'=>'siz yozgan mavzu va xabar;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'sizning litsenziyangiz raqami, shuning uchun to‘lov qilgan mijozlar ustuvorlikka ega bo‘ladi;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'faqat uni belgilasangiz: sayt tafsilotlari (WordPress va PHP versiyalari, tema, plaginlar, parollar va elektron pochta manzillari olib tashlangan xatoliklar jurnali parchasi), uni yuborishdan oldin o‘qib chiqishingiz mumkin;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'faqat ularni qo\'shsangiz: saytingiz uchun loginlar, shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va so\'rovingiz yopilgandan keyin 30 kun o\'tgach o\'chiriladi.','I agree, continue'=>'Roziman, davom etish','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ulanishni tekshirib bo‘lmadi.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Bu ishlamadi. Qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® yordam xizmati ushbu saytni uzib qo‘ydi.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati bu saytni endi tan olmaydi.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Siz bu saytni uzdingiz.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ushbu saytni qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulang','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Ulandi. Javoblar %s ga yuboriladi.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ulanmagan. Quyida elektron pochta manzilingiz bilan soʻrov yuborishingiz mumkin; ulanish uni har safar kiritishdan saqlaydi.','E-mail address'=>'Elektron pochta manzili','Your name (optional)'=>'Ismingiz (ixtiyoriy)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Men ushbu saytni Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulashga roziman. U ushbu sayt manzilini, WordPress va PHP versiyalarini hamda plagin versiyasini yuboradi va uni istalgan vaqtda yerdan yoki Zinn Digital® orqali uzib qo‘yish mumkin.','Connect'=>'Ulashish','I need help'=>'Yordam kerak','Report a bug'=>'Xatolik haqida xabar berish','Send feedback'=>'Fikr-mulohaza yuborish','Request a feature'=>'Funksiya so\'rash','The site details could not be read.'=>'Sayt tafsilotlarini o‘qib bo‘lmadi.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Soʻrovingizni yuborib boʻlmadi. Bir necha daqiqadan soʻng yana urinib koʻring.','WordPress admin'=>'WordPress administratori','File manager'=>'Fayl menejeri','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Fikr-mulohaza va funksiya so‘rovlari','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Yuborildi. Sizning ma\'lumotnomangiz %s, va bizning javobimiz elektron pochta orqali keladi.','What is it about?'=>'Bu nima haqida?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'(Elektron pochtaga) javob berish','Subject'=>'Mavzu','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Nima qildingiz, nimani kutgansiz va buning o\'rniga nima sodir bo\'ldi?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Sayt tafsilotlarini qo‘shish (versiyalar, mavzu, plaginlar, xatoliklar jurnali parchasi)','See exactly what is sent'=>'An aniq nima yuborilganini ko\'ring','Loading…'=>'Yuklanmoqda…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash uchun kirish ma\'lumotlari (ixtiyoriy, shifrlangan holda saqlanadi)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Kirish maʼlumotlari faqat paroli bilan birga yuboriladi. Qatorni chala toʻldirgandan koʻra, uni boʻsh qoldiring.','Login address'=>'Kirish manzili','Add a login'=>'Kirish qo\'shish','Create a temporary support login'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo\'llab-quvvatlash loginini yaratish','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash jamoamiz uchun alohida foydalanuvchi, foydalanuvchilarga kirish huquqi, plaginlarni o\'rnatish yoki kodni tahrirlash imkoniyatisiz. U muddati tugaganda yoki uni quyida istalgan vaqtda bekor qilganingizda avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Ha, %d kun davomida' . "\0" . 'Ha, %d kun davomida','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Ro\'yxatni yuklab bo\'lmadi.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Ushbu kirish ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirib bo\'lmadi.','Temporary support logins'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash uchun kirishlar','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Hech qanday. Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati bu yerda kirish ma’lumotlarini yaratmasangiz, ushbu saytga kira olmaydi.','expired, being removed'=>'muddati o\'tgan, o\'chirilmoqda','expires %s'=>'%s muddati tugaydi','Revoke now'=>'Hozir bekor qilish','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'%2$d qadamdan %1$d-qadam','Close the tour'=>'Turnni yopish','Everything in one place'=>'Barchasi bir joyda','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Ushbu tablar plaginning har bir ekraniga olib boradi: o\'rnatish, sozlamalar, litsenziyangiz, yordam va boshqalar.','Help on every screen'=>'Har bir ekranda yordam','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Hozirgi ekranningiz boʻyicha qoʻllanma, ushbu tanishuv ekskursiyasi yoki bizdan yordam soʻrash uchun ushbu menyuni oching.','Light or dark'=>'Yorug\' yoki qorong\'i','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Yorugʻ, qorongʻi yoki kompyuteringiz sozlamasiga mos rejimni tanlang. Tanlovingiz faqat siz uchun eslab qolinadi.','Welcome'=>'Xush kelibsiz','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ushbu qisqa ekskursiya narsalar qayerda joylashganini ko‘rsatadi. Uni istalgan vaqtda Escape yordamida tark etishingiz mumkin.','Your site at a glance'=>'Bir qarashda sizning saytingiz','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'O\'rnatish jarayoni va sizning rejangiz bu yerda keyingi bajarilishi kerak bo\'lgan muhim qadam bilan birga ko\'rsatiladi.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Sizning rejangiz, u nechta saytni qamrab olishi va saytning ushbu nusxasi shu limitga kirish yoki kirmasligi.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Pro versiyasini sinab ko\'ring yoki yangilang','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Karta talab qilinmaydigan bepul sinov muddatini boshlang, uni yangilang yoki uzaytiring – barchasi shu yerda.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Har bir funksiya va uni o\'z ichiga olgan reja. Funksiyani qidiring yoki bir vaqtning o\'zida bitta hududni ko\'rsating.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital® haqida qo‘shimcha ma’lumot','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Ushbu plagin bilan ishlaydigan plaginlar va ayni jamoaning xizmatlari. Boshqa ekranlarda yashirgan kartochkalaringizni shu yerda qaytadan ko\'rsatish mumkin.','Connect for faster help'=>'Tezkor yordam uchun ulanish','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Ulanish ixtiyoriy. Bu har safar elektron pochtangizni kiritmasdan so‘rovlar yuborish imkonini beradi va xohlagan vaqtda uzib qo‘yishingiz mumkin.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Yordam so\'rash yoki xato haqida xabar berish','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Nima sodir bo\'lganini tasvirlang. Sayt ma\'lumotlarini qo\'shish yoki qo\'shmaslikni o\'zingiz tanlaysiz va avval uning ichida nima borligini aniq ko\'rishingiz mumkin.','Temporary support access'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash ruxsati','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Agar qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati saytingiz ichini ko‘rishi kerak bo‘lsa, bu yerda vaqtinchalik kirish ma’lumotlarini yarating. U muddati tugagach o‘zini o‘chirib tashlaydi va uni istalgan vaqtda o‘chirib tashlashingiz mumkin.','Tell us what to build'=>'Nima qurishimiz kerakligini ayting','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'G‘oya, funksiya so‘rovi yoki har qanday fikr-mulohazani yuboring. U to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri jamoaga borib tushadi.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Bu bir necha daqiqa vaqt oladi va %s ni ushbu saytda darhol ishlaydigan qilib sozlaydi. Keyinchalik hamma narsani o\'zgartirishingiz mumkin.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Siz tayyorsiz. Agar biron narsa kutilganidek ishlamasa, biz birgina tugma bosish masofasidamiz.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'%1$d-qadam (%2$d tadan): %3$s','Finish'=>'Tugatish','Skip setup'=>'O‘rnatishni o‘tkazib yuborish','Import “%s”'=>'"%s" ni import qilish','%d page imported.'=>'%d ta sahifa import qilindi.' . "\0" . '%d ta sahifa import qilindi.','edit'=>'tahrirlash','Pages to import'=>'Import qilinadigan sahifalar','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Sahifalarni hoziroq chop eting (aks holda ular qoralama sifatida saqlanadi)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'To\'plamning bosh sahifasidan saytning asosiy sahifasi sifatida foydalanish','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Import qilingan sahifalar bilan menyu yaratish','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'Import qilish mavjud sahifalaringizni hech qachon o\'zgartirmaydi. Xuddi shu to\'plamni qaytadan import qilish u oldin yaratgan sahifalarni yangilaydi.','Import'=>'Import qilish','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Bir klik bilan import qilishingiz mumkin bo\'lgan to\'liq veb-saytlar: sahifalar, bo\'limlar va menyu, o\'z matn va rasmlaringiz uchun tayyor. To\'plamlar Zinn Digital® tomonidan taqdim etiladi va har oy yangilari qo\'shilib boradi.','Search kits'=>'To\'plamlarni qidirish','Category'=>'Kategoriya','All categories'=>'Barcha kategoriyalar','Free and Pro'=>'Beppul va Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'Pro versiyasiga o\'ting va import qiling','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Bu filtrlarga mos keluvchi to‘plam topilmadi.','My library'=>'Mening kutubxonam','Team'=>'Jamoa','Storage'=>'Xotira','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Kutubxonangiz oʻzingizning xotira bueringizda saqlanadi, shuning uchun hech qanday Zinn Digital® kvotasi amal qilmaydi.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'%2$s dan %1$s ishlatildi (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d / %2$d dizayn · har bir dizayn uchun eng koʻpi bilan %3$s · rasmlar 2560 px gacha oʻlchami oʻzgartiriladi va bir marta saqlanadi','Deleted from your library.'=>'Kutubxonangizdan o\'chirildi.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Muharrirdan istalgan bo‘lim yoki sahifani saqlang: blokning ⋮ menyusini oching va “Bulutli kutubxonaga saqlash” bandini tanlang. Saqlangan dizaynlarni muharrirdagi Bulutli kutubxona panelidan istalgan saytingizga joylashtiring.','Show'=>'Ko\'rsatish','Everything'=>'Hammasi','Sections'=>'Bo\'limlar','Styles'=>'Uslublar','Size'=>'Hajmi','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Hali hech narsa saqlanmagan.','Delete'=>'O‘chirish','Write a test file'=>'Test faylini yozish','Read it back'=>'Qaytadan o\'qish','Delete it'=>'Uni o‘chirish','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'Cloudflare boshqaruv panelida R2 Object Storage\'ni oching va bucket yarating (masalan, “my-pbs-library”). Uni shaxsiy holatda saqlang: ommaviy domenni ulamang.','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'R2\'da “Manage API tokens” bo‘limini oching va faqat o‘sha bitta buket bilan cheklangan, “Object Read & Write” ruxsatiga ega API tokenini yarating.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Kirish Kaliti ID va u ko‘rsatadigan Maxfiy Kirish Kalitini nusxalang (maxfiy kalit faqat bir marta ko‘rsatiladi).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Hisobingiz uchun S3 yakuniy nuqtasini nusxalang. U https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com koʻrinishida boʻladi. Hudud — “auto”.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Quyidagi qiymatlarni joylashtiring, saqlang va so‘ng “Test connection” tugmasini bosing. Kutubxonani faqat sinov muvaffaqiyatli o‘tgandan keyingina o‘z xotirangizga o‘tkazing.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'O\'zingizning provayderingizda (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO yoki har qanday S3-mos keluvchi xizmatda) shaxsiy bucket yarating.','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Faqat o\'sha bucket\'dagi obyektlarni o\'qiy oladigan, yoza oladigan va o\'chira oladigan kirish kalitini yarating.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket’s region.'=>'S3 yakuniy nuqtasini (Amazon S3 uchun: %s) va chelak mintaqasini toping.','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 virtual-hosted manzillaridan foydalanadi: “Path-style addresses” parametrini o‘chirib qo‘ying. Boshqa koʻpchilik xizmatlar path-style usulidan foydalanadi.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Quyidagi qiymatlarni qo\'ying, saqlang va keyin "Ulanishni sinash" tugmasini bosing.','Storage settings saved.'=>'Saqlash sozlamalari saqlandi.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Bulut kutubxonangiz rejangizdagi bo\'sh joy bilan Zinn Digital® xotirasida saqlanadi. Uni o\'zingizning Cloudflare R2 yoki S3 bilan mos keluvchi baketingizda ham saqlashingiz mumkin: shunda Zinn Digital® kvotasi qo\'llanilmaydi va bir xil baketga ulangan har bir sayt kutubxonadan birgalikda foydalanadi. Jamoa kutubxonalari doimo Zinn Digital® xotirasidan foydalanadi.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'O\'z xotirangizni ulang: bosqichma-bosqich','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Boshqa S3-mos xizmat','Read the full guide'=>'To\'liq qo\'llanmani o\'qish','S3 endpoint'=>'S3 yakuniy nuqtasi','Bucket'=>'Konteyner','Region'=>'Mintaqa','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: avtomatik.','Access key ID'=>'Kirish kaliti ID raqami','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Saqlangan. O\'zgarishsiz qoldirish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Secret access key'=>'Maxfiy kirish kaliti','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Ushbu saytda shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va boshqa hech qachon ko\'rsatilmaydi. Saqlab qolish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ushbu saytda shifrlangan holdda saqlanadi. U hech qachon Zinn Digital® ga yuborilmaydi.','Path-style addresses'=>'Yo\'nalish uslubidagi manzillar','Folder in the bucket'=>'Bakdagi papka','Save'=>'Saqlash','Test connection'=>'Ulanishni sinash','Remove these settings'=>'Ushbu sozlamalarni olib tashlash','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Kutubxonamni ushbu xotirada saqlash','The connection test passed.'=>'Ulanish testi muvaffaqiyatli o\'tdi.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Avval “Test connection” ni bajaring.','Invite a site'=>'Saytni taklif qilish','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Kim uchun? (ixtiyoriy)','Access'=>'Kirish','Use designs (read only)'=>'Dizaynlardan foydalanish (faqat o‘qish uchun)','Use and save designs'=>'Dizaynlardan foydalanish va saqlash','Create invite code'=>'Taklif kodini yaratish','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Bu kodni sayt egasiga bering. U bir marta, 7 kun davomida ishlaydi va faqat hozir ko\'rsatiladi:','Copy'=>'Nnusx_copy','Members'=>'A\'zolar','No site has joined yet.'=>'Hali biron-bir sayt ulanmagan.','use and save'=>'ishlatish va saqlash','read only'=>'faqat o\'qish uchun','Delete team'=>'Jamoani o\'chirish','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'Ushbu jamoani va uning kutubxonasidagi barcha dizaynlarni o\'chirishni xohlaysizmi?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Bu sayt jamoa kutubxonasiga qoʻshildi.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Ushbu sayt jamoa kutubxonasidan foydalanadi:','Leave'=>'Chiqish','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Taklif kodi yordamida jamoaga qo\'shiling','Join'=>'Qo\'shilish','Your teams'=>'Sizning jamoalaringiz','New team name'=>'Yangi jamoa nomi','Create team'=>'Jamoa yaratish','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Jamoa kutubxonalarini yaratish Agency rejasiga kiritilgan.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Boʻlimlar, sahifalar va uslublarni bulutli kutubxonangizga saqlang va ularni barcha saytlaringizda qayta foydalaning. Agentliklar kutubxonani oʻz jamoasi va mijozlari bilan baham koʻrishi mumkin. Kutubxonani Zinn Digital® xotirasida yoki oʻzingizning Cloudflare R2 yoki S3-mos keluvchi baketingizda saqlashingiz mumkin.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Page Builder Sandwich Pro versiyasini oling','Website kits'=>'Veb-sayt to‘plamlari','Cloud library'=>'Bulut kutubxonasi','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Zinn Digital® Ltd kompaniyasi bosh direktori Neil Lock tomonidan yaratilgan','Version %s'=>'Versiya %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Page Builder Sandwich veb-sayti','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® veb-sayti','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Pro rejalar va narxlarni ko\'rish','Front-end output'=>'Old tomon chiqishi','Class name prefix'=>'Sinf nomi prefiksi','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Plagin sahifalaringizda chop etadigan har bir klass nomi ushbu prefiks bilan boshlanadi, shuning uchun sahifalar qaysi plagin tomonidan yaratilganini oshkor qilmaydi. Harf bilan boshlanadigan 1 dan 8 gacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlar.','Beta updates'=>'Beta yangilanishlar','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ushbu sayt yangilanish sifatida beta-versiyalarni qabul qiladi.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Bu saytga faqat barqaror versiyalar qabul qilinadi.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Buni Hisob sahifasida o\'zgartiring','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Beta versiyalar o\'z hisobiga ulangan litsenziyaga ega Pro o\'rnatishlariga taqdim etiladi. Ulangandan so\'ng, Hisob sahifasidan qo\'shilishingiz mumkin.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Chegaralar saqlandi. Sahifalar keyingi ko\'rishda yangi kengliklarni qabul qiladi.','Breakpoints'=>'Nuqtalar','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Planshet uchun o‘rnatilgan uslublar planshet kengligigacha, mobil qurilma uchun o‘rnatilganlari esa mobil qurilma kengligigacha amal qiladi. Ish stoli uslublari qolgan barcha joylarda qo‘llaniladi.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Planshet: gacha (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Mobil: (px) gacha','Save breakpoints'=>'Tozalash nuqtalarini saqlash','Use the default widths'=>'Standart kengliklardan foydalanish','Settings'=>'Sozlamalar','Templates & kits'=>'Andozalar va to‘plamlar','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ushbu postni o‘zgartirish so‘rovi yakunlanmasdan to‘xtatildi, shuning uchun post tashlab yuborildi. Uni o‘zgartirish uchun oching yoki bu yerdan qaytadan o‘zgartiring.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Tiklash uchun ushbu postning zaxira nusxasi mavjud emas.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Konvertatsiya qilingan tarkibni saqlab bo‘lmadi.','Unknown error.'=>'Noma\'lum xatolik.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday eski kontent tekshirilmadi.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Eski kontent tiklanmoqda: %1$d / %2$d ta xabar.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Eski kontentni o\'tkazish: %1$d / %2$d ta post.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Bekor qilish yakunlandi: %1$d ta tiklandi, %2$d ta bajarilmadi.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'O‘tkazish yakunlandi: %1$d tasi o‘tkazildi, %2$d tasi o‘zgarishsiz qoldi, %3$d tasi bajarilmadi.','Legacy content'=>'Eski kontent','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Oldingi Page Builder Sandwich versiyalari yordamida yaratilgan sahifalar fonda bloklarga aylantiriladi. Har bir post avval zaxiralanadi, shuning uchun har bir aylantirishni bekor qilish mumkin.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d ta post hali ham eski tarkibni saqlab turibdi.' . "\0" . '%d ta post hali ham eski tarkibni saqlamoqda.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d ta xabar zaxira nusxasiga ega.' . "\0" . '%d ta postning zaxira nusxasi mavjud.','%d post could not be handled'=>'%d ta xabarni qayta ishlab bo‘lmadi' . "\0" . '%d ta xabarni qayta ishlab bo‘lmadi','Post %d'=>'%d-xabar','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Konvertatsiya boshlandi. U fonda davom etmoqda; bu sahifani tark etishingiz mumkin.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'O‘tkazilgan har bir xabarni eski kontentiga tiklaysizmi? Ushbu xabarlar o‘tkazilganidan keyin kiritilgan o‘zgarishlar yo‘qoladi.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Bekor qilish boshlandi. U fonda davom etmoqda; bu sahifadan chiqib ketishingiz mumkin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Barcha o\'zgarishlarni bekor qilish','Item'=>'Element','Open when the page loads'=>'Sahifa yuklanganda ochish','Title is a heading'=>'Sarlavha sarlavha hisoblanadi','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Elementlar sahifa bo‘limlari bo‘lganda sarlavhani sarlavha (heading) qilib qo‘ying, shunda tashrif buyuruvchilar ular orasida o‘tishlari mumkin bo‘ladi.','Heading %d'=>'Sarlavha %d','Question or section title'=>'Savol yoki bo\'lim sarlavhasi','Accordion'=>'Akordeon','Only one item open at a time'=>'Bir vaqtning o\'zida faqat bitta element ochiq bo\'ladi','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'Qidiruv tizimlari uchun FAQ sifatida belgilang','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Sarlavhalar (savollar) va ularning matnidan (javoblaridan) tuzilgan FAQ, ya\'ni tez-tez beriladigan savollar uchun tuzilgan ma\'lumotlarni qo\'shadi.','Alert'=>'Ogohlantirish','Information'=>'Ma\'lumot','Success'=>'Muvaffaqiyat','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Ogohlantirishlar va xatolar ekran oʻquvchi foydalanuvchilariga darhol yetkaziladi; maʼlumot va muvaffaqiyat xabarlari esa ular oʻz ishini tugatgach oʻqib eshittiriladi.','Show icon'=>'Belgini ko\'rsatish','Visitors can close it'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar uni yopishi mumkin','Title (optional)'=>'Sarlavha (ixtiyoriy)','Write the message…'=>'Xabarni yozing…','Centre'=>'Markaz','Badge'=>'Nishon','Colour'=>'Rang','Theme accent'=>'Mavzu urgʻusi','Neutral'=>'Neytral','Position'=>'Pozitsiya','Label'=>'Etiket','Booking calendar'=>'Band qilish taqvimi','Service'=>'Xizmat','Booking page address'=>'Band qilish sahifasi manzili','For example %s'=>'Masalan: %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Ekran o\'quvchilari tomonidan o\'qib beriladigan va uning ostida ko\'rsatiladigan taqvim nima uchun mo\'ljallangani.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Bu %s bron qilish sahifasining manzili emas, shuning uchun sahifada hech narsa ko\'rsatilmaydi.','Preview the calendar'=>'Kalendarni oldindan ko‘rish','Link address'=>'Havola manzili','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Tugmada yorliq ham, manzil ham mavjud boʻlganda u koʻrsatiladi.','Open in a new tab'=>'Yangi oynada ochish','Layout'=>'Maket','Buttons below'=>'Quyidagi tugmalar','Buttons beside the text'=>'Matn yonidagi tugmalar','Alignment'=>'Tekislash','Main button'=>'Asosiy tugma','Second button'=>'Ikkinchi tugma','Heading…'=>'Sarlavha…','One sentence on why…'=>'Nima uchunligi haqida bir gap…','Second button (optional)'=>'Ikkinchi tugma (ixtiyoriy)','Checklist'=>'Tekshiruv ro\'yxati','Tick colour'=>'Belgi rangi','Lines'=>'Qatorlar','Line %d'=>'%d-qator','Task…'=>'Vazifa…','Add line'=>'Qator qo\'shish','Detect automatically'=>'Avtomatik aniqlash','No highlighting'=>'Ajratib ko‘rsatish yo‘q','File name'=>'Fayl nomi','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'Kod ustida ko\'rsatilgan, masalan, functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Satirlar raqamlari','Copy button'=>'Nusxalash tugmasi','Wrap long lines'=>'Uzun qatorlarni o‘rash','Write or paste code…'=>'Kod yozing yoki qo\'ying…','Text'=>'Matn','Columns'=>'Ustunlar','Highlight %s'=>'%s ni ajratib ko\'rsatish','Add column'=>'Ustun qo\'shish','Rows'=>'Qatorlar','Row %d'=>'%d-qator','Add row'=>'Qator qo‘shish','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Izoh (nima taqqoslanmoqda)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Kletka turi: %s. Oʻzgartirish','Phone call'=>'Telefon qo\'ng\'irog\'i','Text message'=>'Matnli xabar','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Tugmalar','Phone number, with country code'=>'Telefon raqami, mamlakat kodi bilan','Button text'=>'Tugma matni','Remove this button'=>'Ushbu tugmani olib tashlash','Add a button'=>'Tugma qo\'shish','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Boshlash uchun WhatsApp xabari (ixtiyoriy)','Contact buttons'=>'Aloqa tugmalari','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Yon panelga telefon raqam, elektron pochta manzili yoki WhatsApp raqamini qo\'shing.','Dual heading'=>'Ikki qavatli sarlavha','Heading level'=>'Sarlavha darajasi','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Har bir sahifada asosiy sarlavha uchun H1 tegidan faqat bir marta foydalaning.','Second part look'=>'Ikkinchi qismni ko\'rish','Accent colour'=>'Aksent rangi','Gradient'=>'Gradent','Outline'=>'Kontur','Underline'=>'Tagiga chiziq tortish','Second part on its own line'=>'Ikkinchi qism alohida qatorda','First part'=>'Birinchi qism','second part'=>'ikkinchi qism','Marker pen'=>'Marker qalam','Thick underline'=>'Qalin tagchiziq','Background'=>'Fon','Highlight'=>'Ajratib koʻrsatish','Remove highlight'=>'Ajratishni olib tashlash','Drop cap'=>'Bosh harf','Large first letter'=>'Katta bosh harf','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Kutadagi birinchi harf uchun "Qutvdagi bosh harf" uslubini tanlang.','Drop cap in a box'=>'Kutadagi bosh harf','Accent bar'=>'Aksent paneli','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Iqtibos bloki (aksent chizig\'i)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Diqqatni tortish uchun rangli chiziq yonida katta qilib qoʻyilgan matndan iqtibos.','quote'=>'taklif','Feature list'=>'Funksiyalar ro\'yxati','On phones the features always stack.'=>'Telefonlarda funksiyalar har doim ustma-ust joylashadi.','Feature %d'=>'Xususiyat %d','Own icon'=>'Maxsus belgi','Feature…'=>'Funksiya…','Describe it…'=>'Uni tavsiflang…','Add feature'=>'Funksiya qo\'shish','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms yoki Fluent Forms-ni o\'rnating va faollashtiring, so\'ngra uning shakllaridan birini bu yerdan tanlang.','Form plugin'=>'Form plagini','Choose a form…'=>'Shakl tanlang…','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s da hali formalar mavjud emas','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s ushbu saytda faol emas, shuning uchun bu fɔrma koʻrsatilishi mumkin emas.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'Formalar roʻyxatini yuklab boʻlmadi.','Form style'=>'Forma uslubi','Fields'=>'Maydonlar','Outlined'=>'Konturli','Filled'=>'To\'ldirilgan','Underlined'=>'Tag ostiga chizilgan','Button width'=>'Tugma kengligi','Fit the text'=>'Matnga moslashtirish','Full width'=>'To\'liq kenglik','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Ranglar, shriftlar, oraliq masofalar va burchaklar saytingiz dizaynidan hamda ushbu blokning dizayn sozlamalaridan kelib chiqadi.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'Saytingizga moslab bezatilgan, forma plaginidan formani ko\'rsating.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Form plaginiga ehtiyojingiz bormi? Contact Form 7 bepul.','Glossary'=>'Lug\'at','Sort A to Z'=>'A dan Z gacha saralash','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Sahifa shartlarni alifbo tartibida ko\'rsatadi; bu yerda ular siz yozgan tartibda qoladi.','Show an A–Z index'=>'A–Z indeksini ko\'rsatish','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Ushbu sahifaning boshqa qismlarida ishlatilgan havola atamalari','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links 