\'rsatiladigan tafsilotlar','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Ko\'rsatish uchun kamida bitta tafsilotni tanlang.','Progress bar'=>'Jarayon paneli','Maximum'=>'Maksimal','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'Foiz uchun 100; istalgan boshqa raqam miqdor uchun, masalan, 10 tadan 8 tasi.','Show the percentage'=>'Foizni ko\'rsatish','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'Parol o\'rnatilgan. Tashrif buyuruvchilar uni kiritmagunicha ushbu kontent o\'rniga parol formasini ko\'rishadi.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Hali parol o\'rnatilmagan, shuning uchun tashrif buyuruvchilar bu yerda hech narsa ko\'rishmaydi.','New password'=>'Yangi parol','Set the password'=>'Parolni o\'rnatish','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'Parol o\'rnatildi. Uni qo\'llash uchun sahifani saqlang; uni ochgan tashrif buyuruvchilarga yangisi kerak bo\'ladi.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Agar Page Builder Sandwich o\'chirilsa, bu kontent barchaga ko\'rsatiladi.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Parol shakri ustidagi xabar (ixtiyoriy)','A/B test'=>'A/B test','Test name'=>'Sinov nomi','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'B versiyasini ko\'rgan tashrif buyuruvchilar (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Maqsad (ixtiyoriy)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Konversiya – bu versiya ichidagi havola yoki tugmaga bosish yoki yuborilgan forma. Sahifaning boshqa joyidagi bosishni hisoblash uchun uning CSS selektorini kiriting, masalan, #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Natijalarni koʻrish','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'A/B testiga aniq ikkita versiya kerak.','Button'=>'Tugma','Visit site'=>'Saytga tashrif buyurish','Style'=>'Uslub','Affiliate button'=>'Sheriklik tugmasi','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Tugmaga uning matnini va yon panelda taklif manzilini kiriting.','Age check'=>'Yoshni tekshirish','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Bu blokni uni talab qiladigan har bir sahifaga yoki butun saytni qamrab olish uchun sarlavha shablon qismiga qo‘ying.','Minimum age'=>'Minimal yosh','Ask for'=>'So\'rash','A yes or no answer'=>'Ha yoki yo\'q javobi','The date of birth'=>'Tug\'ilgan sana','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'(days) uchun javobni eslab qolish','Texts'=>'Matnlar','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Standart matndan foydalanish uchun maydonni bo\'sh qoldiring. {age} minimal yosh bilan almashtiriladi.','Question'=>'Savol','When the visitor is too young'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchi yoshi juda kichik bo\'lganda','Countries'=>'Mamlakatlar','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Mamlakatdan kelgan tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun boshqa minimal yosh yoki saytni u uchun yopish uchun 0. Mamlakat xostingiz yoki CDN\'ingizdan (masalan, Cloudflare) keladi; u noma\'lum bo\'lgan taqdirda, yuqoridagi minimal yosh qo\'llaniladi. Ushbu qoidalar keshoblangan sahifalarga qo\'llanilishi uchun sahifa keshi har bir mamlakat uchun bitta nusxani saqlashi shart.','Add a country'=>'Mamlakat qo\'shish','Country code (two letters)'=>'Mamlakat kodi (ikki harfli)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Masalan US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Minimal yosh (0: yopiq)','Age gate'=>'Yosh cheklovi','The age question shows here.'=>'Yosh savoli shu yerda ko\'rsatiladi.','Changing words'=>'So\'zlarni o\'zgartirish','Word'=>'So‘z','Add a word'=>'So‘z qo‘shish','Animated headline'=>'Animated sarlavha','Text before'=>'Oldingi matn','Text after'=>'Matndan keyingi','Effect'=>'Ta\'sir','Fade'=>'Sustirish','Slide up'=>'Yuqoriga surish','Typing'=>'Yozilmoqda','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Har bir so\'z uchun vaqt (millisekundlarda)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Blok sozlamalarida o\'zgaradigan so\'zlarni qo\'shing.','Typewriter'=>'Yozuv mashinkasi','Words fade in'=>'Matn paydo bo\'lishi','Words rise in'=>'So\'zlar ko\'paymoqda','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Matn ekranga ko‘ringanda bir marta ijro etiladi. Qurilmasidan harakatni kamaytirishni so‘ragan tashrif buyuruvchilar matnni harakatsiz ko‘rishadi.','Speed'=>'Tezlik','Slow'=>'Sekin','Normal'=>'Normal','Fast'=>'Tez','Write the text to animate…'=>'Animatsiya qilinadigan matnni yozing…','Audio player'=>'Audio pleyer','Show or album name'=>'Shou yoki albom nomi','Replace artwork'=>'San\'at asarini almashtirish','Choose artwork'=>'Rasm tanlash','Add an episode'=>'Epizod qo\'shish','Choose audio file'=>'Audio faylni tanlash','Replace audio file'=>'Audio faylni almashtirish','or its address'=>'yoki uning manzili','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Yon panelga epizodlar qo\'shing.','Author box'=>'Muallif oynasi','Picture size (pixels)'=>'Rasm o\'lchami (piksellarda)','Link to the author’s posts'=>'Muallifning postlariga havola','Link to their website'=>'Ularning veb-saytiga havola','Name as'=>'Nomlash','Heading 2'=>'2-sarlavha','Heading 3'=>'3-sarlavha','Heading 4'=>'4-sarlavha','Paragraph'=>'Matn qismi','The author of the post shows here.'=>'Maqola muallifi bu yerda ko\'rsatiladi.','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Ekran o‘qigichlari tomonidan o‘qib beriladi va “Yorliqni ko‘rsatish” yoniq bo‘lganda ko‘rsatiladi.','Show label'=>'Yorliqni ko\'rsatish','Corner'=>'Burchak','End (right in English)'=>'Oxiri (i