ys at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar sahifani aylantirganda ekranning yuqori qismida qoladi.','Transparent'=>'Shaffof','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Sahifaning birinchi qismi ustida joylashadi va sahifa aylantirilganda saytning fon rangini oladi. Birinchi qismga yuqorida yetarli joy bering.','Slides come from'=>'Slaydlar quyidagidan keladi','Blocks I add'=>'Men qo‘shgan bloklar','Posts'=>'Maqolalar','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Mahsulotlar (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Slayd','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (sekin yaqinlashtirish, rasmlar)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Ko‘rinishdagi slaydlar: ish stoli','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Ko\'rinishdagi slaydlar: planshet','Slides in view: phone'=>'Ko‘rinishdagi slaydlar: telefon','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Slaydlar nima ekanligi, masalan, "Mijozlar hikoyalari".','Image slider'=>'Rasm slayderi','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Media kutubxonadagi rasmlar, birin-ketin.','Post slider'=>'Xabar slayderi','Product slider'=>'Mahsulotlar slayderi','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'WooCommerce mahsulotlari karusel sifatida.','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Ken Burns slayd-shousi','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Sekin yaqinlashadigan va biri ikkinchisiga o\'tib boradigan to\'liq kenglikdagi rasmlar.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'So\'nggi savdo xabarnomalari — misol, faqat muharrirda ko\'rsatiladi','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Town dan First name Product sotib oldi','2 hours ago'=>'2 soat oldin','Orders'=>'Buyurtmalar','Orders from'=>'Buyurtmalar:','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce va Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Easy Digital Downloads','Most recent orders to show'=>'Ko\'r