ress, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Veb-manzil, telefon havolasi (tel:) yoki istalgan matnni kiriting.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Bu QR kod uchun juda uzun. Uni qisqartiring.','Add a caption'=>'Izoh qoʻshish','Reading progress bar'=>'O\'qish jarayoni paneli','Edge of the window'=>'Oyna cheti','Top'=>'Eng yuqori','Bottom'=>'Pastki','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar pastga aylantirganda oyna ostida ko\'rsatiladi.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar pastga aylantirganda oyna yuqorisida ko\'rsatiladi.','Related by'=>'Muallifi','Categories or tags'=>'Kategoriyalar yoki teglar','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Hech narsa bog\'liq bo\'lmaganda, uning o\'rniga eng yangisini ko\'rsatish','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'"O\'xshash xabarlar" uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Show the featured image'=>'Taqdim etilgan rasmni ko\'rsatish','Show a summary'=>'Xulosani ko\'rsatish','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Hozircha bu postning toifalari yoki teglarini boʻlishadigan boshqa postlar yoʻq. Ular paydo boʻlganda, shu yerda koʻrsatiladi.','Modal'=>'Modal oynasi','Off-canvas panel'=>'Yondan ochiladigan panel','Slides in from'=>'Dan surilib keladi','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Boshlanish – bu o\'qish boshlanadigan tomon: ingliz tilida chap tomon, arab tilida o\'ng tomon.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Orqa tarafdagi sahifa bosilganda yopish','Title of the window'=>'Oyna sarlavhasi','Check mark'=>'Belgi','Cross'=>'Kesib o\'tish','Dot'=>'Nuqtacha','Arrow'=>'Ko\'rsatkich','Star'=>'Saralash','Icon colour'=>'Belgi rangi','Same as the text'=>'Matn bilan bir xil','Theme primary'=>'Asosiy mavzu','Theme secondary'=>'Ikkilamchi mavzu','Theme contrast'=>'Mavzu kontrasti','Keep headings in order down the page: a heading one level below the 