liq qoʻshish','Testimonial'=>'Tavsiya','Choose photo'=>'Fotoni tanlash','Remove photo'=>'Rasmni o\'chirish','Photo description'=>'Surat tavsifi','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'Agar fotosuratda faqat yonida ismi koʻrsatilgan shaxs tasvirlangan boʻlsa, uni boʻsh qoldiring.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Yulduzli reyting (0 = yo\'q)','Name under the quote'=>'Iqtibos ostidagi nom','Photo beside the quote'=>'Iqtibos yonidagi rasm','What the customer said…'=>'Mijoz nima dedi…','Role or company'=>'Rol yoki kompaniya','Tooltip'=>'Maslahat oynasi','Tooltip text'=>'Maslahat matni','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Uni qisqa tuting: bir yoki ikki jumla. Ekran o‘quvchilari uni tushuntirayotgan so‘z bilan birga o‘qiydi.','Show it'=>'Koʻrsatish','Above'=>'Yuqori','Below'=>'Quyida','Word or phrase'=>'So\'z yoki ibora','Profile'=>'Profil','Whose profile'=>'Kimning profili','The post’s author'=>'Maqola muallifi','Show the profile picture'=>'Profil rasmini ko‘rsatish','Show the biography'=>'Tarjimai holni ko\'rsatish','Show links to posts and website'=>'Xabarlar va veb-sayt havolalarini ko\'rsatish','Author profile'=>'Muallif profili','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Qaysi profil koʻrsatilishini tanlang.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'WhatsApp raqami, mamlakat kodi bilan','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Masalan, +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Boshlash uchun xabar (ixtiyoriy)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Belgini yonida matnni ko\'rsatish','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Pastgi qism (ingliz tilida o‘ngda)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Pastki qism boshlanishi (ingliz tilida chapda)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Yon panelga WhatsApp raqamingizni qo‘shing. Ungacha tugma sahifada ko‘rsatilmaydi.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'Sahifada bu tugma ekranning pastki burchagida suzib yuradi.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'Bulutli kutubxonangizga saqlandi.','Save to cloud library'=>'Bulut kutubxonasiga saqlash','Save to'=>'Quyidagiga saqlash','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Rasmlarning hajmi o\'zgartiriladi, bir marta saqlanadi va ushbu dizaynni kiritgan har qanday saytning media kutubxonasiga qaytariladi.','%s style'=>'%s uslubi','Save style to cloud library'=>'Uslubni bulut kutubxonasiga saqlash','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Avval blokni tanlang, so‘ngra uslubni qo‘llang.','Library'=>'Kutubxona','Save this page to the library'=>'Ushbu sahifani kutubxonaga saqlash','Insert'=>'Kiritish','Shortcode tag'=>'Qisqa kod tegi','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Faqat harflar, raqamlar, defis va pastki chiziqlardan foydalaning.','Attribute name'=>'Atribut nomi','Add attribute'=>'Atribut qo\'shish','Shortcode'=>'Qisqa kod','Other attributes'=>'Boshqa atributlar','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Blok sozlamalarida shortkod tegini tanlang.','Image size'=>'Rasm hajmi','Thumbnail'=>'Miniatyura','Full size'=>'Asl hajm','Link to'=>'Ushbu manzilga havola','Attachment page'=>'Ilova sahifasi','Media file'=>'Media fayli','Audio'=>'Audio','Video'=>'Video','File address'=>'Fayl manzili','Poster image'=>'Poster tasviri','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'Media ID\'lari, vergul bilan ajratilgan','Show the track list'=>'Treklar roʻyxatini koʻrsatish','Embed'=>'Joylashtirish','Address to embed'=>'Joylashtirish manzili','Maximum width'=>'Maksimal kenglik','Image and caption HTML'=>'Rasm va sarlavha HTML','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Maslahat: Forma bloki ushbu formani saytingizga mos ravishda bezatilgan holda ko\'rsatadi.','Show the form title'=>'Form sarlavhasini ko\'rsatish','Show the form description'=>'Form tavsifini ko\'rsatish','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Sahifani qayta yuklamasdan yuborish','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Eski muharrirdagi "%s" boshqaruv elementi blokli muharrirda mavjud emas. Qiymatni matn sifatida kiriting.','Choose file'=>'Faylni tanlash','— Default —'=>'— Standart —','Advanced styling'=>'Kengaytirilgan uslublar','Inline CSS'=>'Ichki CSS','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'CSS deklaratsiyalari, masalan: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Effektlar (eskirgan sinflar)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Eski versiyalardan saqlanib qolgan bo‘sh joy bilan ajratilgan effekt nomlari, masalan: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'To‘liq kenglik, kontent o‘rtada saqlanadi','Link relationship'=>'Havola munosabati','Left'=>'Chap','Right'=>'O‘ng','Add text…'=>'Matn qo\'shish...','Placement'=>'Joylashuv','On its own line'=>'Alohida qatorda','In the line, beside other content'=>'Qatorda, boshqa tarkib yonida','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Avtomatik (sahifaning yuqori darajasida o\'z qatorida)','Accessible label'=>'Ochiq yorliq','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Dekorativ ikonka uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Blok sozlamalaridan ikonkani tanlang.','New setting name'=>'Yangi sozlama nomi','For example: title or text'=>'Masalan: sarlavha yoki matn','Add setting'=>'Sozlamani qo‘shish','Widget'=>'Vidjet','Choose a widget'=>'Vidjetni tanlang','Widget area'=>'Vidjet maydoni','Choose a widget area'=>'Vidjet maydonini tanlang','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Bu rasmda kenglik va balandlik koʻrsatilmagan, shuning uchun sahifa yuklanganda sakrab qoladi. Uni Media kutubxonasidan tanlang yoki kenglik va balandligini oʻrnating.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Bu video Media Library dan emas, shuning uchun uning hajmi noma\'lum va u yuklanganda sahifa sakrab ketadi. Buning o\'rniga uni Media Library ga yuklang.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Ushbu HTML\'dagi rasm, video yoki kadrda kenglik va balandlik ko\'rsatilmagan, shuning uchun sahifa yuklanganda sakrab qoladi. Unga width va height atributlarini qo\'shing.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Ushbu vidjet yuklangandan keyin oʻlchamini oʻzgartiradi va uning ostidagi kontentni siljitadi. Unga joy ajrating yoki sahifada pastroqqa joylashtiring.','Layout shift'=>'Maket siljishi','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Bu vidjet o\'z sozlamalarini tavsiflamaydi, shuning uchun ular nom va qiymat juftliklari sifatida tahrirlanadi.','Problem'=>'Muammo','Check'=>'Tekshirish','Show block'=>'Blokni ko\'rsatish','Use a readable theme colour'=>'O‘qishga qulay mavzu rangidan foydalaning','Make it H%d'=>'H%d ga aylantirish','Alt text'=>'Muqobil matn','Save alt text'=>'Muqobil matnni saqlash','This image is decorative'=>'Bu rasm bezak uchun','Checking…'=>'Tekshirilmoqda…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Ushbu sahifada hech qanday foydalanish imkoniyati muammolari topilmadi.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'%d ta muammo' . "\0" . '%d ta muammo','%d thing to check'=>'Tekshirilishi kerak bo\'lgan narsa: %d' . "\0" . 'Tekshirish kerak bo\'lgan %d ta narsa','Check again'=>'Qayta tekshirish','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Avtomatik tekshiruv ko\'plab muammolarni topadi, ammo ularning barchasini emas. Shuningdek, sahifani faqat klaviatura yordamida va ekran o\'quvchi yordamida sinab ko\'ring.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Matn kontrasti %1$s:1; o‘qilishi uchun kamida %2$s:1 talab qilinadi.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'bu yerga bosing,bu yerda,batafsil o\'qish,ko\'proq,havola,ushbu havola,ko\'proq bilib olish,o\'tish','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Havolada matn yo‘q, shuning uchun ekrandan o‘qituvchi dastur faqat “link” deb o‘qiydi. Matn yoki yorliq qo‘shing.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'"%s" havolasi matni uning qayerga olib borishini ko‘rsatmaydi. Buning o‘rniga manzilni tavsiflang.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Element musbat tabindex\'ga ega, bu esa klaviatura tartibini o\'qish tartibidan o\'zgartiradi. 0 dan foydalaning yoki uni olib tashlang.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Bosish mumkin bo\'lgan elementga klaviatura yordamida kirib bo\'lmaydi. Haqiqiy tugma yoki havoladan foydalaning.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Oʻrnatilgan freymda sarlavha yoʻq, shuning uchun ekran oʻquvchi uning nima ekanligini ayta olmaydi.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Forma maydonida yorliq yo‘q, shuning uchun uning vazifasi e’lon qilinmagan.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Bu sarlavha boʻsh. Ekran oʻquvchi dastur foydalanuvchilari sarlavhalar boʻyicha harakatlanishadi; uni olib tashlang yoki matn qoʻshing.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Sahifa sarlavhasi allaqachon H1 hisoblanadi; kontentning eng yuqori darajasi uchun H2 dan foydalaning.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'Bu H%1$d darajani o\'tkazib yuboradi; undan oldingisi esa H%2$d. Uni H%3$d ga o\'zgartiring.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Bu rasmda alt-matn mavjud emas. Uni tavsiflang yoki qo\'shimcha qiymat bermasa, dekorativ sifatida belgilang.','Close panel'=>'Panelni yopish','Desktop'=>'Ish stoli','Default'=>'Standart','Every track'=>'Har bir trek','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Trek o\'lchamlari, masalan: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Maxsus trek o‘lchamlari','Equal tracks'=>'Teng treklar','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Har bir qatorda bitta qo‘shtirnoq ichidagi qator, masalan: "head head" "side main". Har bir bola blokdagi sohaga nom bering.','Automatic'=>'Avtomatik','Square (1:1)'=>'Kvadrat (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Standard (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Klassik (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Keng (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Kinoteatr (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Baland (9:16)','Custom'=>'Maxsus','Width / height'=>'Eni / balandligi','Background image'=>'Fon rasmi','Inherited image — replace'=>'Meros qilib olingan tasvir — almashtirish','Cover'=>'Muqova','Contain'=>'O\'z ichiga oladi','Original size'=>'Asl o‘lcham','Repeat'=>'Takrorlash','No repeat'=>'Takrorlanmasin','Tile'=>'Plitka','Tile across'=>'Kataklar bo\'ylab','Tile down'=>'Kichiklashtirish','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Aylantirilganda qotirilgan','Solid'=>'Barqaror','Dashed'=>'Shtrixli','Dotted'=>'Nuqtali','Double'=>'Ikki marta','Each side separately'=>'Har bir tomon alohida','Side'=>'Yon','Add a shadow'=>'Soyaga qo\'shish','Horizontal'=>'Gorizontal','Vertical'=>'Vertikal','Blur'=>'Xiraqlashtirish','Spread'=>'Tarqatish','Inside'=>'Ichkarida','Remove this shadow'=>'Bu soykani olib tashlash','Opacity'=>'Shaffoflik','Transform'=>'Transformatsiya qilish','Shadow'=>'Soya','Ease'=>'Qulaylik','Linear'=>'Chiziqli','Ease in'=>'Osonlik bilan','Ease out'=>'Osonlashtirish','Ease in and out'=>'Sekin-asta boshlash va to‘xtatish','Duration (milliseconds)'=>'Davomiyligi (millisekundlarda)','What animates'=>'Nima harakatga keltiradi','Easing'=>'Yengillashtirish','Delay (milliseconds)'=>'Kechikish (millisekundlarda)','Remove the preset'=>'Andozani olib tashlash','More options'=>'Qo\'shimcha parametrlar','Number and unit'=>'Raqam va birlik','Custom CSS value (calc, clamp…)'=>'Maxsus CSS qiymati (calc, clamp…)','Set each side separately'=>'Har bir tomonni alohida sozlash','Set all sides together'=>'Barcha tomonlarni birgalikda o\'rnatish','All sides'=>'Barcha tomonlar','Top start'=>'Yuqori bosh qism','Top end'=>'Eng yuqori chegara','Bottom start'=>'Pastki boshlanish','Bottom end'=>'Pastki qism','Between rows'=>'Qatorlar oralig\'ida','Between columns'=>'Ustunlar oralig\'ida','Choose a preset'=>'Standart sozlamani tanlang','Presets'=>'Andozalar','Preset: %s'=>'Oldindan sozlangan: %s','Spacing'=>'Oraliq masofa','Typography'=>'Tipografiya','Colours & background'=>'Ranglar va fon','Border'=>'Chegara','Effects'=>'Ta\'sirlar','Motion'=>'Harakat','Advanced'=>'Kengaytirilgan','up to %d px'=>'%d px gacha','from %d px'=>'%d px dan boshlab','all widths'=>'barcha kengliklar','Screen size'=>'Ekran o\'lchami','Hover'=>'Kursor bilan o‘tish','Reset every value set for %s'=>'%s uchun o\'rnatilgan har bir qiymatni tiklash','Inherited from %s'=>'%s dan meros qolgan','Reset %s'=>'%s ni tiklash','Hide on'=>'Oʻchirish','%1$s (%2$d set)'=>'%1$s (%2$d ta to\'plam)','Replace icon'=>'Belgini almashtirish','No icons match.'=>'Hech qanday belgi mos kelmadi.','Regular'=>'Oddiy','Brands'=>'Brendlar','Sharp'=>'O‘tkir','Bold'=>'Qalin','Fill'=>'Toʻldirish','Duotone'=>'Duotone','This icon set could not be loaded. Check your connection and try again.'=>'Ushbu ikonka to‘plamini yuklab bo‘lmadi. Internet aloqasini tekshiring va qayta urinib ko‘ring.','Search icons'=>'Belgilarni qidirish','Search all sets'=>'