ish orqasida (%)','Tint (use a see-through colour)'=>'Tus (shaffof rangdan foydalanish)','Blob'=>'Blob','Hexagon'=>'Oltiburchak','Triangle'=>'Uchburchak','Diamond'=>'Olмос','Heart'=>'Sevimlilar','Arch'=>'Arxitektura','Brush stroke'=>'Mo‘yqalam urishi','Mask shape'=>'Niqob shakli','Custom image'=>'Maxsus tasvir','Replace mask image'=>'Niqob rasmini almashtirish','Choose mask image'=>'Niqob rasmini tanlang','Fit'=>'Mos kelish','Repeat across'=>'Hammasiga qo\'llash','Repeat down'=>'Pastdan takrorlash','Space out'=>'Oraliq masofa qoldirish','Stretch to fit'=>'Moslashtirib cho\'zish','Multiply'=>'Ko‘paytirish','Screen'=>'Ekran','Overlay'=>'Ustma-ust qatlam','Darken'=>'To\'qroq qilish','Lighten'=>'Och rangli','Colour dodge'=>'Rangli yorugʻlashtirish','Colour burn'=>'Rangni kuydirish','Hard light'=>'Qattiq yorugʻlik','Soft light'=>'Yumshoq yorug\'lik','Difference'=>'Farq','Exclusion'=>'Istisno','Hue'=>'Rang tusor','Saturation'=>'To\'yinganlik','Luminosity'=>'Luminosity','Blend mode'=>'Aralashma rejimi','Blur (px)'=>'Xiralashish (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Yorqinlik (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Kontrast (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Kulrang shkala (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Rang aylanishi (gradus)','Saturation (%)'=>'To\'yingish (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Matn soyasi','Across (px)'=>'Eniga (px)','Down (px)'=>'Past past (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Yumshoqlik (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Soy soya rangi','Remove drop shadow'=>'Soya tashlashni olib tashlash','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Har qanday ekran o\'lchamiga qo\'llaniladi.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Dizayn panelida tanlangan ekran o\'lchamiga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi.','Background gradient'=>'Orqa fon градиенти','Add gradient'=>'Gradent qo\'shish','Glass'=>'Shisha','Mask'=>'Niqob','Filters'=>'Filtrlar','Wave'=>'Toʻlqin','Waves'=>'To\'qinlar','Curve'=>'Egri chiziq','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Egri (asimmetrik)','Arc'=>'Yoy','Tilt'=>'Nishon','Tilt (layered)'=>'Qiyalik (qatlamli)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Uchburchak (assimetrik)','Split'=>'Bo\'lish','Zigzag'=>'Zigzag','Mountains'=>'Tog\'lar','Clouds'=>'Bulutlar','Drops'=>'Tomchilar','Pyramids'=>'Piramidalar','Book'=>'Band qilish','Stairs'=>'Pillapoya','Fan'=>'Ventilyator','Height (px)'=>'Balandlik (px)','Mirror'=>'Nnusxona','Invert'=>'Ters qilish','In front of the content'=>'Kontent oldida','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Video fayl (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'MP4 yoki WebM videoni tanlang','MP4 address'=>'MP4 manzili','WebM address'=>'WebM manzili','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'YouTube video ID (11 ta belgi)','Vimeo video number'=>'Vimeo video raqami','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar video xizmatiga faqat ushbu bo‘limga aylantirib o‘tgandagina murojaat qilishadi va ularning qurilmasi harakatni kamaytirishni so‘raganda hech qachon murojaat qilishmaydi. Ungacha ular poster tasvirini ko‘radilar.','Replace poster image'=>'Plakat rasmini almashtirish','Choose poster image'=>'Plakat rasmini tanlang','Background slideshow'=>'Fon slayd-shousi','Change images'=>'Rasmlarni o\'zgartirish','Choose at least two images.'=>'Kamida ikkita rasm tanlang.','Seconds per image'=>'Har bir rasm uchun soniyalar','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Sekin masshtablash (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Slayderni o\'chirish','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Oʻz qurilmasida harakatni kamaytirishni soʻragan tashrif buyuruvchilar faqat birinchi rasmni koʻradilar.','Section effects'=>'Bo\'lim effektlari','Top divider'=>'Yuqori ajratuvchi chiziq','Bottom divider'=>'Pastki ajratuvchi','Choose the logo'=>'Logotipni tanlang','Not set'=>'Oʻrnatilmagan','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Brend ranglarini tekshiring: har biri o\'ziga xos nom va yaroqli rangga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','Brand name'=>'Brend nomi','A logo is chosen.'=>'Logotip tanlandi.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Sayt dizayni sahifasidan logotipni tanlang.','Brand colours'=>'Brend ranglari','Brand %d'=>'Brend %d','Add brand colour'=>'Brend rangini qo\'shish','Heading font'=>'Sarlavha shrifti','Body font'=>'Asosiy shrift','Tone of voice'=>'Ovoz ohangi','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Brendingiz qanday yozadi, masalan, “Do\'stona va sodda, qisqa jumlalar, atamalarsiz.” sun\'iy intellekt ushbu sayt uchun har safar yozganda unga amal qiladi.','Brand kit saved.'=>'Brend to‘plami saqlandi.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'Brend qo\'llandi: uning ranglari, shriftlari va logotipi endi saytniki.','Apply to site'=>'Saytga qo\'llash','All classes'=>'Barcha sinflar','Class name on the page'=>'Sahifadagi sinf nomi','Printed as %s.'=>'%s sifatida chop etildi.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Harf bilan boshlang‘; faqat kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislar.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Uslub boshqaruvlari yuklanmadi. Sahifani qayta yuklang; agar muammo saqlanib qolsa, plaginni qayta o‘rnating.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'Sinf saqlandi. Undan foydalanadigan har bir element yangi uslubga ega.','Save class'=>'Sinflni saqlash','Class created.'=>'Sinf yaratildi.','New class'=>'Yangi sinf','e.g. Card'=>'masalan: Karta','Create'=>'Yaratish','Search classes'=>'Sinf qidirish','No class matches.'=>'Mos keladigan sinf yo\'q.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Hozircha sinflar yo\'q. YARATING, uslub bering va so\'zlamalaridan istalgan elementga qo\'shing.','Edit %s'=>'%s-ni tahrirlash','Class duplicated.'=>'Sinf nusxalandi.','Delete %s'=>'%s ni o\'chirish','Class deleted.'=>'Klass o‘chirildi.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'"%s" sinfini o\'chirishni xohlaysizmi? Undan foydalanadigan elementlar o\'z kontentini saqlab qoladi, lekin uslublarini yo\'qotadi.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Faqat filtrlashdan oʻtmagan HTML qoʻshish huquqiga ega boʻlgan foydalanuvchilaragina maxsus CSS\'ni oʻzgartira oladi.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Ushbu CSS\'ning ayrim qismlari ishlatilmaydi: xavfsizlik maqsadida @import, expression(), javascript: URL\'lari, "<" va muvozanatsiz qavslar olib tashlanadi.','Upload a font'=>'Shriftni yuklash','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Shriftlarni yuklash uchun WordPress 6.5 yoki undan keyingi versiyasi talab qilinadi.','Font name'=>'Shrift nomi','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'masalan: Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s yuklandi va foydalanishga tayyor.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Shrift faylini tanlang (%s)','Font library'=>'Shriftlar kutubxonasi','%d files'=>'%d ta fayl','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Sayt uchun shrift o\'chirilgan.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Sayt uchun shrift yoqildi.','Switch off'=>'O‘chirish','Switch on'=>'Yoqish','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Adobe Fonts veb-loyihangizning kit ID raqamini kiriting. Shundan so\'ng uning shriftlari sahifalaringizga Adobe\'dan yuklanadi.','Your web projects'=>'Sizning veb-loyihalaringiz','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts ullandi.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts uzluki uzildi.','Kit id'=>'To\'plam identifikatori','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" uchun qorong‘i qiymat yaroqli rang emas.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Mehmon tanlamaganda','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchining qurilmasiga ergashish','Dark colours'=>'To\'q ranglar','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Har bir rang uchun qorong‘i versiyasini ko‘rsating. Bo‘sh qoldirilgan ranglar ikkala rejimda ham o‘zgarmasdan qoladi. Qorong‘i rejim kamida bitta rang uchun qorong‘i qiymat kiritilganda yoqiladi.','Dark version of %s'=>'%s ning qorong‘i versiyasi','Dark mode saved.'=>'Qora rejim saqlandi.','Page CSS'=>'Sahifa CSS','Global classes'=>'Global klasslar','Classes'=>'Sinflar','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Sayt dizaynida sinflar yarating, so\'ngra ularni shu yerga qo\'shing.','Custom CSS'=>'Maxsus CSS','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Ushbu element uchun qoidalar yozing. "selector" ushbu elementni bildiradi, masalan, selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — oddiy e\'lonlar elementining o\'ziga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Shrift fayllari %s bo\'lishi kerak.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Bu shrift fayli bo\'sh yoki hajmi 10 MB dan katta.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Bir marta uslub bering, hamma joyda qayta foydalaning, bir joyda o\'zgartiring.','Variables'=>'O\'zgaruvchilar','Named values any element can use.'=>'Har qanday element foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan nomlangan qiymatlar.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Oraliq masofa, radius va soyalar','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Har bir oraliq, burchak va soyani tanlash vositasi taqdim etadigan masshtablar.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Buni xohlaydigan tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun ranglaringizning qorong‘i versiyasi.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt va shablonlar tomonidan ishlatiladigan logotip, ranglar, shriftlar va ohang.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'O\'z shriftlaringizni yuklang yoki Adobe Fonts\'ni ulang.','CSS for this page only.'=>'Faqat ushbu sahifa uchun CSS.','CSS for this page'=>'Ushbu sahifa uchun CSS','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Faqat ushbu sahifada, sayt uslublaridan keyin yuklanadi. Sahifa bilan birga saqlanadi.','Short name'=>'Qisqa nom','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'"%s" qisqa nomi ikki marta ishlatilgan.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": qisqa nomlarda kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan foydalaniladi.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'"%s" qiymati ushbu sozlama tomonidan qabul qilinmaydi.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Qadam qo\'shish','Scales saved.'=>'Masshtablar saqlandi.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Masshtablar odatiy qiymatlarga qaytarildi.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Standart masshtablarga tiklash','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Hozircha o\'zgaruvchilar yo\'q. O\'zgaruvchi bitta qiymatni — kenglik, ranglar aralashmasi, shrift o\'lchamini — ko\'plab elementlar bo\'lishadigan qiymatni saqlaydi.','Add variable'=>'O\'zgaruvchi qo\'shish','Variables saved.'=>'O\'zgaruvchilar saqlandi.','Entrance animation'=>'Kirish animatsiyasi','Fade in'=>'Sekin paydo boʻlish','Fade in, rising'=>'Ko\'tarilib, asta-sekin paydo bo\'lish','Fade in, dropping'=>'Sekin ochilish, tushish','Fade in from the start side'=>'Boshlanish tomonidan asta-sekin paydo bo\'lish','Fade in from the end side'=>'Oxirgi tarafdan asta-sekin paydo bo\'lish','Zoom out'=>'Kichiklashtirish','Flip up'=>'Tepadagi','Animation length (ms)'=>'Animatsiya davomiyligi (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Animatsiya kechikishi (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Aylantirish paytida','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Koʻrinishga kelganda asta-sekin paydo boʻlishi','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Ko\'rinishga kelganda ko\'tarilish','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Sahifa aylantirilganda o‘ssin','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Ko\'rinishga kelib qolganda to\'g\'rilang','On hover'=>'Kursorni olib borganda','Lift'=>'Ko‘tarish','Glow'=>'Porlash','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Ko‘rinishda qolish (yuqoridan px)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Parallaks tezligi (-10 dan 10 gacha)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Ko‘rsatkichga amal qilish (kuchi)','Place ID'=>'Joylashuv ID','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Google Place ID qidiruvchisi yordamida toping: biznesingizni qidiring va ID\'ni nusxalang.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Places API (New) yoqilgan Google Cloud loyihangizdan API kaliti. Uni faqat shu API bilan cheklang.','Business unit ID'=>'Biznes bo‘linmasi identifikatori','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'Trustpilot Business hisob qaydangizdagi (Integrations › API) Trustpilot\'dagi biznesingizning 24 belgidan iborat identifikatori.','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Trustpilot Business hisob qaydangizning API kaliti.','Not set up.'=>'Sozlanmagan.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Saqlangan kalitni endi o\'qib bo\'lmaydi (saytning xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni qaytadan kiriting.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Ham ID, ham API kaliti talab qilinadi.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Sozlash. Google sharhlari Sharhlar bloki mavjud bo\'lgan sahifa har safar ko\'rilganda jonli ravishda yuklanadi: har bir ko\'rish uchun o\'zingizning kalitingiz bo\'yicha bitta Joy tafsilotlari so\'rovi, hech qachon saqlanmaydi (Google shartlari ularni saqlashga ruxsat bermaydi).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Birinchi yangilanish muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Birinchi yangilanish kutilmoqda (bir yoki ikki daqiqa ichida).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'Yangilandi %1$s: %2$d ta sharh saqlab qolindi, bahosi %3$s (%4$d ta sharh asosida).','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Oxirgi urinish (%1$s) muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi va yuqoridagi sharhlar saqlanib qoldi: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'Saqlandi. Trustpilot sharhlari bir-ikki daqiqada fonda yuklab olinadi; Google sharhlari sahifada jonli ravishda yuklanadi.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Trustpilot sharhlari fond rejimida kuniga bir marta olinib, saytingizda saqlanadi, shuning uchun gavjum sahifa Trustpilot hisobingizga qo\'shimcha xarajat keltirmaydi; agar yangilash muvaffaqiyatsiz tugasa, oxirgi sharhlar qoladi. Google o\'z sharhlarini saqlashga ruxsat bermaydi, shuning uchun ular tashrif buyuruvchi sahifani ko\'yganda jonli ravishda yuklanadi: har bir ko\'rish Google tomonidan haq to\'lanadigan o\'zingizning Google kalitingizdagi bitta so\'rovdir.','Where to find it'=>'Uni qayerdan topish mumkin','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'Saqlandi (…%s). Uni almashtirish uchun yangisini kiriting.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'%s tafsilotlarini va uning sharhlarini olib tashlash','Refreshed.'=>'Yangilandi.','Refresh now'=>'Hozir yangilash','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Keyingi kunlik yangilanish: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Google va Trustpilot tafsilotlaringiz, Sharhlar bloki uchun.','No colours yet.'=>'Hozircha ranglar yo\'q.','Colour %d'=>'Rang %d','Add colour'=>'Rang qo‘shish','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Ikki rang bir xil nomga ega. Bittasining nomini o\'zgartiring.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" yaroqli rang emas.','Theme colours'=>'Mavzu ranglari','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Mavzungizning palitrasi. Bu yerdagi o‘zgarish Sayt muharriri uni qanday saqlasa, xuddi shunday tarzda saytingizning rang versiyasi sifatida saqlanadi va rang ishlatilgan barcha joylarga tatbiq etiladi.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Mavzu ranglari o‘zining asl qiymatlariga qaytarildi.','Reset theme colours'=>'Mavzu ranglarini asl holatiga qaytarish','Your colours'=>'Sizning ranglaringiz','Colours saved.'=>'Rangлар сақланди.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'%s uchun rang tanlang','Clear'=>'Tozalash','The change could not be saved.'=>'Oʻzgarishni saqlab boʻlmadi.','Theme default'=>'Mavzu standart holda','Theme fonts'=>'Mavzu shriftlari','Your fonts'=>'Sizning shriftlaringiz','Font stack'=>'Shriftlar steklari','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Yuklangan shrift: uning fayllari shriftlar kutubxonasidan olingan.','System sans-serif'=>'Tizimli sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Shriftlar stekini qo‘shish','Fonts saved.'=>'Shriftlar saqlandi.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Mavzuingiz va Sayt muharriri bilan umumiy foydalanishda.','Fonts'=>'Shriftlar','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Butun sayt uchun sarlavha va asosiy matn shriftlari.','Back to Site design'=>'Sayt dizayniga qaytish','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Klasslar, tokenlar, qorong‘i rejim, brend to‘plami va maxsus shriftlar Pro versiyasida taqdim etiladi','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Sayt muharririning uslublarini ochish','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Stil oynasi yordamida uslublangan, qatorlararo balandligi qisqaroq sarlavha.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Style yorlig\'i bilan bezatilgan matn qismi.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Style yorlig‘i yordamida bezatilgan, chetlari yumaloqlangan rasm.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Media kutubxonasidan olingan va Style (Uslub) tabida bezatilgan video.','Spacer'=>'Ajratuvchi','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Bloklar orasidagi bo‘sh joy; Style (Stil) oynasida har bir ekran o‘lchami uchun alohida balandlikni o‘rnating.','Divider'=>'Ajratuvchi chiziq','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Bo\'limlar orasidagi gorizontal chiziq, Style (Uslub) oynasi yordamida bezatilgan.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Manzilini kiritish orqali boshqa saytdagi kontentni (video, post, xarita) qo\'shing.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Style yorlig‘i yordamida bezatilgan to‘r shaklidagi bir nechta rasmlar.','Plain'=>'Oddiy','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Almashtirish uchun tillar mavjud emas. Almashtirgich tarjima plagini ikkita yoki undan ortiq tilni ko‘rsatganda paydo bo‘ladi.','Switcher'=>'O‘tkazgich','Show the current language'=>'Joriy tilni ko\'rsatish','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Tranzly\'ni o\'rnating va ikki yoki undan ortiq tilni qo\'shing, shundan so\'ng almashtirgich shu yerda paydo bo\'ladi.','Pills'=>'Kapsulalar','Dropdown'=>'Ochiluvchi ro‘yxat','Language codes'=>'Til kodlari','Show each language as'=>'Har bir tilni quyidagicha ko\'rsatish:','Language name'=>'Til nomi','Language code'=>'Til kodi','Name and code'=>'Nomi va kodi','Flags'=>'Bayroqchalar','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Standart bo\'yicha o\'chirilgan: bayroq bu til emas, balki mamlakat.','Include the current language'=>'Joriy tilni kiritish','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ushbu sahifa tarjima qilinmagan tillarni yashirish','Stack vertically'=>'Vertikal ravishda joylashtirish','Current language text'=>'Joriy til matni','Current language background'=>'Joriy til fonlari','Size and spacing'=>'Hajmi va oraligʻi','Space between languages'=>'Tillalar orasidagi bo\'shliq','Text size'=>'Matn hajmi','Connected (key %s).'=>'Ulandi (kalit %s).','API URL'=>'API URL','Replace the API key'=>'API kalitini almashtirish','Where to find your %s API key'=>'%s API kalitini qayerdan topish mumkin','Check and save'=>'Tekshirish va saqlash','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'Mating-list xizmatini bir marta ulang; shundan so‘ng istalgan forma uni to‘ldirgan shaxslarni sizning ro‘yxatlaringizdan biriga qo‘shishi mumkin (forma blokining sozlamalari → Yuborilgandan keyin). Kalitlar xizmat yordamida tekshiriladi, ushbu saytda shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va boshqa hech qachon ko‘rsatilmaydi.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'Forma topsshirishlari va tugma bosishlarini kod yozmasdan analitikangizga yuboring. Biror xizmatni o‘tkazib yuborish uchun uning ID raqamini bo‘sh qoldiring. Tugmalarning Kengaytirilgan panelida "Konversiya hodisasi" maydoni mavjud bo‘ladi. Cookie-fayllar banneri yoqilgan bo‘lsa, tashrif buyuruvchi rozilik bermaguncha hech narsa yuklanmaydi.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Google Analytics 4 o‘lchov identifikatori','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'Google Tag Manager konteyner identifikatori','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Meta Pixel ID (Meta Hodisalar Menejeri\'da ko\'rsatilgan raqam)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Ushbu teglarni saytimga yuklash','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Agar mavzuingiz yoki boshqa plagingiz ularni allaqachon qo\'shgan bo\'lsa, o\'chirib qo\'ying; hodisalar baribir yuboriladi.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Formaga yuborilgan ma\'lumotlar uchun hodisa nomi','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Banner — bu bloklar yordamida loyihalashtiradigan popup. Uning tugmalari #consent-accept, #consent-reject va #consent-save havolalariga o\'tadi ("save" uchun analytics va marketing deb nomlangan belgilash katakchalari bilan); istalgan joydagi #consent-open havolasi uni qaytadan ko\'rsatadi. Tashrif buyuruvchi qabul qilmaguncha, kuzatuv teglari yuklanmaydi, Google Consent Mode holati "denied" bo\'lib qoladi va siz ro\'yxatga kiritgan skriptlar o\'chirilgan holda qoladi.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Tayyor banner yaratish','Show a cookie banner'=>'Cookie banner\'ini ko\'rsatish','Banner'=>'Banner','Choose a popup…'=>'Pop-up oynasini tanlang...','%s (draft)'=>'%s (qoralama)','Edit the banner'=>'Bannerga o\'zgartirish kiritish','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Tanlovni (days) kun uchun eslab qolish','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'Yevropa Ittifoqi, EEA va Buyuk Britaniyadan tashqarida: tashrif buyuruvchi rad etmaguncha yuklanishni kuzatish','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'O‘chirilgan: har bir tashrifchi oldindan rozi bo‘lishi shart (eng qat\'iy qoida va standart). Yoqilgan: faqat xostingiz yoki CDN tashrifchining mamlakatini aniqlaganda (masalan, Cloudflare\'ning CF-IPCountry sarlavhasi orqali) va u EU, EEA, UK hamda Shveytsariyadan tashqarida bo‘lsa. Banner baribir ko‘rsatiladi va noma\'lum mamlakat EU ichida deb hisoblanadi.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Rozachilik olinguncha saqlab turiladigan boshqa skriptlar (handle:analytics yoki handle:marketing, vergul bilan ajratilgan)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Qalqib chiquvchi oyna, slaydlar va panellar','A/B test results'=>'A/B test natijalari','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'Qoʻllanmalar: shakllar, qalqib chiquvchi oynalar, harakat, kuzatuv, A/B testlari va kuki banneri','Mailing-list connections'=>'Pochta roʻyxati ulanishlari','Popup settings'=>'Qalqib chiquvchi oyna sozlamalari','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'Chiquynsa oynasi (o‘rtada, sahifa xira)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Slayd-in (burchakda)','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'Panel (yuqori yoki pastki)','Bottom, end side'=>'Pastgi, oxirgi tomon','Bottom, start side'=>'Pastki, boshlanish tomoni','When the page loads'=>'Sahifa yuklanganda','After a delay'=>'Kechikishdan keyin','After scrolling part of the page'=>'Sahifaning bir qismini aylantirgandan so\'ng','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'Mehmon chiqib ketmoqchi bo\'lganda','When something is clicked'=>'Biror narsa bosilganda','Percent of the page'=>'Sahifaning foizi','CSS selector of the element'=>'Elementning CSS selektori','How often'=>'Qanchalik chastikda','Every page view'=>'Har bir sahifa ko\'rishlari','Once per visit'=>'Har bir tashrif uchun','Once every few days'=>'Bir necha kunda bir marta','Until the visitor converts'=>'Mehmon konvertatsiya qilgunga qadar','Every page'=>'Har bir sahifa','The front page'=>'Bosh sahifa','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'Tanlangan sahifalar (ID\'lar)','Chosen content types'=>'Tanlangan kontent turlari','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'Sahifa ID lari, vergul bilan ajratilgan','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'Kontent turlari, vergul bilan ajratilgan (post, sahifa, mahsulot)','Devices'=>'Qurilmalar','Desktop only'=>'Faqat kompyuter uchun','Mobile only'=>'Faqat mobil qurilmalar uchun','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'Qoraytirilgan sahifa bosilganda yopish','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'Qalqib chiquvchi oynani yopish uchun tugmani #popup-close, yoki konversiyani hisoblash uchun #popup-convert bilan bog\'lang.','Conversion event'=>'Konversiya voqeasi','Sent to your analytics when this is clicked (for example sign_up). Set up the services under Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.'=>'Bu bosilganda analitika tizimingizga yuboriladi (masalan, sign_up). Xizmatlarni Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing bo\'limida sozlang.','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'AI agentlariga ruxsat berilgan. Vositalarni ko‘rish uchun ushbu sahifani qayta yuklang.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'AI agentlari o\'chirilgan. Ularning ulanish manzili endi javob bermayapti.','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s shuningdek ushbu sahifani tahrirlamoqda. Saqlash ularning o\'zgarishlarini ustiga yozib yuborishi mumkin.','Block library'=>'Bloklar kutubxonasi','Layers'=>'Qatlamlar','Page canvas'=>'Sahifa kanvasi','Revisions'=>'Tahrirlar','Block settings'=>'Blok sozlamalari','Add block: %s'=>'Blok qo\'shish: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Studio\'da ochish: %s','Undo'=>'Bekor qilish','Redo'=>'Qayta bajarish','Show or hide layers'=>'Qatlamlarni ko\'rsatish yoki yashirish','Show or hide the block library'=>'Blok kutubxonasini ko\'rsatish yoki yashirish','Show revisions'=>'Tahrirlarni ko\'rsatish','Open the normal editor'=>'Oddiy muharrirni ochish','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Klaviatura yorliqlari','Preview: desktop'=>'Oldindan koʻrish: kompyuter','Preview: tablet'=>'Ko‘rish: planshet','Preview: mobile'=>'Koʻrish: mobil','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Tanlangan blok uslubidan nusxalash','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Tanlangan blokga uslubni joylashtirish','Copy the selected section'=>'Tanlangan qismdan nusxa olish','Paste a copied section'=>'Nusxalangan boʻlimni qoʻyish','Turn off safe mode'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni o\'chirish','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni yoqish (boshqa plaginlar o\'chirilgan, siz uchun, faqat Studio\'da)','Scheduled'=>'Rejalashtirilgan','Pending review'=>'Koʻrib chiqilmoqda','Private'=>'Maxfiy','Draft'=>'Qoralama','All changes saved'=>'Barcha oʻzgarishlar saqlandi','Saving…'=>'Saqlanmoqda…','Autosaving…'=>'Avtomatik saqlanmoqda…','Unsaved changes'=>'Saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar','autosaved'=>'avtomatik saqlangan','Desktop preview'=>'Ish stoli oldindan ko‘rinishi','Tablet preview'=>'Planshet oldindan ko‘rinishi','Mobile preview'=>'Mobil oldindan ko\'rish','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'%1$s oldindan koʻrish (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Studio asboblar paneli','Back to the normal editor'=>'Oddiy muharrirga qaytish','Page title'=>'Sahifa sarlavhasi','Preview width'=>'Ko\'rish kengligi','Command palette'=>'Buyruqlar paneli','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Sahifani koʻrish (yangi oynada ochiladi)','Save draft'=>'Qoralamani saqlash','Publish'=>'Nashr qilish','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Saqlanmagan o\'zgarishlarni tiklash kerakmi?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Bu sahifada saqlanmagan o\'zgarishlar mavjud. Ular ushbu brauzerda saqlab qolingan:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Bu sahifaning saqlangan versiyasiga qaraganda yangiroq avtomatik saqlangan nusxasi mavjud:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Saqlanmagan o\'zgarishlarni tiklash','Discard'=>'Bekor qilish','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Tuzatishlarni yuklab boʻlmadi.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Tahrir tiklandi. Saqlash uchun saqlang yoki orqaga qaytish uchun bekor qiling.','Close revisions'=>'Tahrirlarni yopish','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Hozircha o\'zgartirishlar yo\'q. Har bir saqlash bittasini yaratadi.','Revision from %s'=>'%s dan tahrir','Restore this revision'=>'Ushbu tahrirni tiklash','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Xavfsiz rejimni o‘zgartirib bo‘lmadi.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Xavfsiz rejim yoqilgan.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%d ta boshqa plagin siz uchun va faqat Sandwich Studio\'da o\'chirilgan. Jonli sayt va boshqa foydalanuvchilar ta\'sir qilmaydi.' . "\0" . '%d ta boshqa plagin siz uchun va faqat Sandwich Studio’da o‘chirilgan. Asosiy sayt va boshqa foydalanuvchilar ta’sir qilmaydi.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Xavfsiz rejim: Studiodagi boshqa plaginlarni faqat o\'zingiz uchun o\'chirib qo\'ying','Save as pattern'=>'Naqsh sifatida saqlash','Synced'=>'Sinxronlangan','Editing the pattern later changes it everywhere it is used.'=>'Naqshni keyinroq tahrirlash u ishlatilgan hamma joyda uni o\'zgartiradi.','Each copy can be edited on its own.'=>'Har bir nusxani alohida tahrirlash mumkin.','Save your changes.'=>'O\'zgarishlarni saqlash.','Undo your last change.'=>'Oxirgi oʻzgarishni bekor qilish.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Oxirgi bekor qilgan amalni qaytadan bajaring.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Qatlamlar panelini ko\'rsatish yoki yashirish.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Ushbu klaviatura yorliqlarini ko\'rsatish.','Select a block first.'=>'Avval blokni tanlang.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Stil nusxalandi. Uni istalgan blokga, ushbu saytda yoki boshqasida joylang.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Brauzer nusxalashni rad etdi.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'Boʻlim nusxalandi. Uni shu saytdagi yoki boshqa istalgan sahifaga qoʻying.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Almashinuv buferida Sandwich Studio\'dan nusxalangan uslub mavjud emas.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Uslub %d ta blokga qo‘shildi.' . "\0" . '%d ta blokga uslub qo\'shildi.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Bu uslub tanlangan blokga mos kelmaydi.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Veb-sahifaga nusxa ko‘chirilmagan.','Section pasted.'=>'Boʻlim qoʻyildi.','Paste style'=>'Uslubni joylash','Paste section'=>'Bo‘limni qo‘yish','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Joylab qo‘yish uchun bu yerda Ctrl+V (Mac\'da Cmd+V) tugmalarini bosing','Copy style'=>'Uslubdan nusxalash','Copy section'=>'Bo‘limdan nusxa olish','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio\'da tahrirlash','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Saqlash amalga oshmadi. Internet aloqangizni tekshirib, qayta urinib ko\'ring, o\'zgarishlaringiz ushbu brauzerda saqlanib qoladi.','Published.'=>'Chop etilgan','Post types (none = any)'=>'Maqola turlari (hech biri = istalgan)','Posts or pages (type to search)'=>'Maqolalar yoki sahifalar (qidirish uchun yozing)','Terms (type to search)'=>'Shartlar (qidirish uchun yozing)','Blog page'=>'Blog sahifasi','Author archives'=>'Muallif arxivleri','Date archives'=>'Sanalar bo\'yicha arxivlar','%s archives'=>'